rulings: ['[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': "Can\'t target itself because you choose the target before you tap him. At that time he is not yet a legal target."}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': "If the creature is no longer tapped when the Assassin\'s ability resolves, then the ability doesn\'t resolve."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'Because the "search" requires you to find a card with certain characteristics, you don\\\'t have to find the card if you don\\\'t want to.\'}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'The land does not count toward your one per turn limit because it was put onto the battlefield by an effect.\'}]', "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Does not trigger on a card on the battlefield being changed into a creature.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The ability will not trigger on itself entering the battlefield, but it will trigger on any other creature that is put onto the battlefield at the same time.'}, {'date': '2005-08-01', 'text': 'The life gain is mandatory.'}, {'date': '2005-08-01', 'text': 'Two Soul Wardens entering the battlefield at the same time will each cause the other’s ability to trigger.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If Howling Mine leaves the battlefield before it resolves, then the last known tap or untap state of the card is used for resolution.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'It does not trigger at all if this is tapped at the start of the draw step, and it checks this again on resolution.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The additional draw is separate from any other draw during your draw step. It happens when the triggered ability resolves.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'The triggered ability is put onto the stack after you have already drawn your card for the turn.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'If a creature has more than one creature type, and one of those types matches the creature you are calculating for, then count that creature. Only one type needs to match in order to get counted.\'}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'If you have a creature with more than one creature type, count all creatures which have either creature type.\'}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "Sharing multiple creature types doesn\'t give an additional bonus. Coat of Arms counts creatures, not creature types."}]', "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If multiple cards are drawn at once, this card triggers once for each card drawn.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'In a multi-player game, it affects all opponents.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If a spell or ability causes you to put cards into your hand without specifically using the word “draw,” it’s not a card drawn.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If multiple “extra turn” effects resolve in the same turn, take them in the reverse of the order that the effects resolved.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If there are no creatures in the player’s library, then the target creature is still destroyed, you see all the cards in that player’s library, and then they shuffle and continue play.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'A “creature card” is any card with the type creature, even if it has other types such as artifact, enchantment, or land. Older cards of type summon are also creature cards.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If the targeted creature is an illegal target by the time Polymorph would resolve, the entire spell doesn’t resolve. Nothing else happens.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If there are no creature cards in the player’s library, all the cards in that library are revealed, then the library is shuffled. (The targeted creature remains destroyed.)'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'If the targeted creature has indestructible, it’s still a legal target — it just isn’t destroyed. The rest of Polymorph’s effect happens as normal.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Regenerating artifacts can regenerate from this.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The player can put the cards in their graveyard in any order they choose.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'This card has a triggered ability that causes a separate effect for 1 point of damage each time a land is tapped for mana.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If any lands are tapped for mana while a player is casting a spell or activating an ability, Manabarbs’s ability will trigger that many times and wait. When the player finishes casting that spell or activating that ability, it’s put on the stack, then Manabarbs’s triggered abilities are put on the stack on top of it. The Manabarbs abilities will resolve first.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'On the other hand, a player can tap lands for mana, let the Manabarbs triggered abilities be put on the stack, and then respond to those abilities by casting an instant or activating an ability using that mana. In that case, the spell or ability will resolve first.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'The ability will trigger each time a land is tapped for mana. Each ability is separate.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'This ability is not a mana ability. It goes on the stack and can be responded to.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Whether or not a creature is without flying is only checked on resolution.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2004-12-01\', \'text\': "Effects that say the game is a draw, such as the _Legends_(TM) card Divine Intervention, are not affected by Platinum Angel. They\'ll still work."}, {\'date\': \'2004-12-01\', \'text\': "You can concede a game while Platinum Angel on the battlefield. A concession causes you to leave the game, which then causes you to lose the game (Once you concede, you no longer control a Platinum Angel, so its ability can\'t prevent you from losing the game)."}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "If you control Platinum Angel in a Two-Headed Giant game, your team can\'t lose the game and the opposing team can\'t win the game."}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "No game effect can cause you to lose the game or cause any opponent to win the game while you control Platinum Angel. It doesn\'t matter whether you have 0 or less life, you\'re forced to draw a card while your library is empty, you have ten or more poison counters, you\'re dealt combat damage by Phage the Untouchable, your opponent has Mortal Combat with twenty or more creature cards in their graveyard, or so on. You keep playing."}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "Other circumstances can still cause you to lose the game, however. You will lose a game if you concede, if you\'re penalized with a Game Loss or a Match Loss during a sanctioned tournament due to a DCI rules infraction, or if your _Magic Online_(R) game clock runs out of time."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2005-06-01\', \'text\': "If you name a card that has both a mana ability and another activated ability, the mana ability can be activated but the other ability can\'t be activated."}, {\'date\': \'2005-06-01\', \'text\': "Pithing Needle affects cards regardless of what zone they\'re in. This includes cards in hand, cards in the graveyard, and exiled cards. For example, a player can\'t cycle Eternal Dragon or return an Eternal Dragon from their graveyard to hand if Pithing Needle naming Eternal Dragon is on the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2005-06-01\', \'text\': "You can name any card, even if that card doesn\'t normally have an activated ability. You can\'t name a token unless that token has the same name as a card."}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': \'Once Pithing Needle has left the battlefield, activated abilities of sources with the chosen name can be activated again.\'}, {\'date\': \'2012-10-01\', \'text\': \'Activated abilities include a colon and are written in the form "[cost]: [effect]." Triggered abilities and static abilities of the named card work normally.\'}]', "[{'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'Twincast copies any text spliced onto the targeted spell, but you can’t splice additional text onto the copy.'}, {'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'You can’t choose to pay any additional costs for the copy. However, effects based on any additional costs paid for the targeted spell are copied as though those same costs were paid for the copy too.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'As Twincast resolves, it creates a copy of a spell. That copy is created on the stack, so it’s not “cast.” Abilities that trigger when a player casts a spell won’t trigger. The copy will then resolve like a normal spell, after players get a chance to cast spells and activate abilities.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If the copy says that it affects “you,” it affects the controller of the copy, not the controller of the original spell. Similarly, if the copy says that it affects an “opponent,” it affects an opponent of the copy’s controller, not an opponent of the original spell’s controller.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If the spell Twincast copies has an X whose value was determined as it was cast (like Earthquake does), the copy has the same value of X.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If the spell Twincast copies is modal (that is, it says “Choose one —” or the like), the copy will have the same mode. You can’t choose a different one.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'The copy will have the same targets as the spell it’s copying unless you choose new ones. You may change any number of the targets, including all of them or none of them. If, for one of the targets, you can’t choose a new legal target, then it remains unchanged (even if the current target is illegal).'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'Twincast can target (and copy) any instant or sorcery spell, not just one with targets. It doesn’t matter who controls it.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2006-10-15\', \'text\': \'Anything that triggers during the resolution of this will wait to be put on the stack until everything is put onto the battlefield and resolution is complete. The player whose turn it is will put all of their triggered abilities on the stack in any order, then each other player in turn order will do the same. (The last ability put on the stack will be the first one that resolves.)\'}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "Taking it slowly, here\'s what happens when Warp World resolves: 1) Each player counts the number of permanents they own. 2) Each player shuffles those permanents into their library. 3) Each player reveals cards from the top of their library equal to the number that player counted. 4) Each player puts all artifact, land, and creature cards revealed this way onto the battlefield. All of these cards enter the battlefield at the same time. 5) Each player puts all enchantment cards revealed this way onto the battlefield. An Aura put onto the battlefield this way can enchant an artifact, land, or creature that was already put onto the battlefield, but can\'t enchant an enchantment that\'s being put onto the battlefield at the same time as it. If multiple players have Auras to put onto the battlefield, the player whose turn it is announces what their Auras will enchant, then each other player in turn order does the same, then all enchantments (both Auras and non-Auras) enter the battlefield at the same time. 6) Each player puts all of their other revealed cards (instants, sorceries, planeswalkers, and Auras that can\'t enchant anything) on the bottom of their library in any order."}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': \'Tokens are permanents but not cards. They’ll count toward the number of permanents shuffled into your library, so you’ll get a card back for each token you owned. But the tokens themselves should be ignored while you’re revealing *cards* from your library. In practice, you shouldn’t actually shuffle them into your library since they’ll cease to exist as soon as Warp World finishes resolving. Note that a token’s owner is the player under whose control it first entered the battlefield.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': \'If a permanent leaves the battlefield this way but ends up in a zone other than a library (most likely because it’s a player’s commander in the Commander variant), it’s still counted to determine how many cards to reveal.\'}]', "[{'date': '2007-02-01', 'text': 'The creature is sacrificed at the end of every turn in which it is on the battlefield. There is no choice about what turn to sacrifice it.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2007-05-01\', \'text\': \'Putting the card onto the battlefield is optional. When the ability resolves, you can choose not to.\'}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': \'A "creature card" is any card with the type creature, even if it has other types such as artifact, enchantment, or land. Older cards of type summon are also creature cards.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2007-07-15\', \'text\': \'Any enters-the-battlefield abilities of the copied creature will trigger when Clone enters the battlefield. Any “as [this creature] enters the battlefield” or “[this creature] enters the battlefield with” abilities of the chosen creature will also work.\'}, {\'date\': \'2007-07-15\', \'text\': \'If the chosen creature is a token, Clone copies the original characteristics of that token as stated by the effect that put it onto the battlefield. Clone is not a token.\'}, {\'date\': \'2007-07-15\', \'text\': \'If the chosen creature is copying something else (for example, if the chosen creature is another Clone), then your Clone enters the battlefield as whatever the chosen creature copied.\'}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': \'If the chosen creature has {X} in its mana cost (such as Protean Hydra), X is considered to be zero.\'}, {\'date\': \'2012-07-01\', \'text\': "Clone copies exactly what was printed on the original creature and nothing more (unless that creature is copying something else or is a token; see below). It doesn\'t copy whether that creature is tapped or untapped, whether it has any counters on it or Auras attached to it, or any non-copy effects that have changed its power, toughness, types, color, or so on."}, {\'date\': \'2012-07-01\', \'text\': "If Clone somehow enters the battlefield at the same time as another creature, Clone can\'t become a copy of that creature. You may choose only a creature that\'s already on the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2012-07-01\', \'text\': \'You can choose not to copy anything. In that case, Clone enters the battlefield as a 0/0 Shapeshifter creature, and is probably put into the graveyard immediately.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-07-01\', \'text\': "Clone\'s ability doesn\'t target the chosen creature."}]', "[{'date': '2007-10-01', 'text': 'The power and toughness of the Avatar created by the third ability will change as your life total changes.'}, {'date': '2007-10-01', 'text': 'The vigilance granted to a creature by the second ability remains until the end of the turn even if the +1/+1 counter is removed.'}]", "[{'date': '2007-10-01', 'text': 'To activate the second ability, you choose a value of X equal to or less than the number of loyalty counters on Chandra Nalaar. You may choose 0. You can’t choose a negative number.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-04-01', 'text': 'If you control 0 swamps, then the Nightmare has 0 toughness and will be put into its owner’s graveyard as a state-based action right before the next player gains priority.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'Nightmare’s power and toughness changes as the number of Swamps you control changes.'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'Nightmare’s ability counts all lands you control with the subtype Swamp, not just ones named Swamp.'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'The ability that defines Nightmare’s power and toughness works everywhere, not just on the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-04-01', 'text': 'This card now uses the Reach keyword ability to enable the blocking of flying creatures. This works because a creature with flying can only be blocked by creatures with flying or reach.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-08-01', 'text': 'If the Giant’s power and/or toughness change so that its toughness is less than its power, you can have the ability target the Giant itself.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If Stone Giant’s ability is activated during a turn’s end step, the delayed triggered ability won’t trigger until the beginning of the next turn’s end step. The targeted creature will be destroyed at that time.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'To work as an evasion ability, an attacking creature must already have flying when the declare blockers step begins. Once a creature has become blocked, giving it flying won’t change that.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'When the delayed triggered ability resolves, the targeted creature is destroyed, even if it’s no longer a creature, no longer under your control, or no longer has toughness less than Stone Giant’s power at that time.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-08-01', 'text': 'The ability triggers even if the Specter’s damage is being redirected to an opponent. It does not trigger if damage that would have been dealt to the opponent is redirected to a nonopponent player or a creature, or if the damage is prevented.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-02-01', 'text': 'The number of targets must be at least 1 and at most 3.'}, {'date': '2009-02-01', 'text': 'You divide the damage as you cast Ignite Disorder, not as it resolves. Each target must be assigned at least 1 damage.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'The number of targets chosen for Ignite Disorder must be at least 1 and at most 3. You divide the damage as you cast the spell, not as it resolves. Each target must be assigned at least 1 damage.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "As this is entering the battlefield, it checks for lands that are already on the battlefield. It won\'t see lands that are entering the battlefield at the same time (due to Warp World, for example)."}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "This checks for lands you control with the land type Forest or Plains, not for lands named Forest or Plains. The lands it checks for don\'t have to be basic lands. For example, if you control Hallowed Fountain (a nonbasic land with the land types Plains and Island), Sunpetal Grove will enter the battlefield untapped."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "As this is entering the battlefield, it checks for lands that are already on the battlefield. It won\'t see lands that are entering the battlefield at the same time (due to Warp World, for example)."}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "This checks for lands you control with the land type Island or Swamp, not for lands named Island or Swamp. The lands it checks for don\'t have to be basic lands. For example, if you control Blood Crypt (a nonbasic land with the land types Swamp and Mountain), Drowned Catacomb will enter the battlefield untapped."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "As this is entering the battlefield, it checks for lands that are already on the battlefield. It won\'t see lands that are entering the battlefield at the same time (due to Warp World, for example)."}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "This checks for lands you control with the land type Mountain or Forest, not for lands named Mountain or Forest. The lands it checks for don\'t have to be basic lands. For example, if you control Temple Garden (a nonbasic land with the land types Forest and Plains), Rootbound Crag will enter the battlefield untapped."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "As this is entering the battlefield, it checks for lands that are already on the battlefield. It won\'t see lands that are entering the battlefield at the same time (due to Warp World, for example)."}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "This checks for lands you control with the land type Plains or Island, not for lands named Plains or Island. The lands it checks for don\'t have to be basic lands. For example, if you control Watery Grave (a nonbasic land with the land types Island and Swamp), Glacial Fortress will enter the battlefield untapped."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "As this is entering the battlefield, it checks for lands that are already on the battlefield. It won\'t see lands that are entering the battlefield at the same time (due to Warp World, for example)."}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "This checks for lands you control with the land type Swamp or Mountain, not for lands named Swamp or Mountain. The lands it checks for don\'t have to be basic lands. For example, if you control Stomping Ground (a nonbasic land with the land types Mountain and Forest), Dragonskull Summit will enter the battlefield untapped."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "Elvish Archdruid\'s first ability affects only other Elves you control. However, Elvish Archdruid\'s second ability counts all Elves you control — including itself."}, {\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': "Elvish Archdruid\'s activated ability is a mana ability. It doesn\'t use the stack and players can\'t respond to it."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "Sanguine Bond\'s ability triggers just once for each life-gaining event, whether it\'s 1 life from Soul Warden or 8 life from Tendrils of Corruption."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "Each creature with lifelink dealing combat damage causes a separate life-gaining event. For example, if two creatures you control with lifelink deal combat damage at the same time, Sanguine Bond\'s ability will trigger twice and you may choose a different opponent for each trigger. However, if a single creature you control with lifelink deals combat damage to multiple creatures, players, and/or planeswalkers at the same time (perhaps because it has trample or was blocked by more than one creature), the ability will trigger only once."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'If an ability triggers whenever an opponent loses life and causes you to gain life, such as the ability of Exquisite Blood, this will loop until either you win the game or a player takes an action to break the loop. If neither of these happen, the game ends in a draw.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'If you gain an amount of life "for each" of something, that life is gained as one event and Sanguine Bond\\\'s ability triggers only once.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "To have any effect, Merfolk Sovereign\'s activated ability must be activated before the declare blockers step begins. Once a Merfolk has become blocked, activating Merfolk Sovereign\'s ability won\'t change that."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "“Protection from Demons and from Dragons” means the following: -- Baneslayer Angel can\'t be blocked by creatures with the creature type Demon or the creature type Dragon. -- Baneslayer Angel can\'t be targeted abilities from sources with the creature type Demon or the creature type Dragon, or by spells with either of those types. -- All damage that would be dealt to Baneslayer Angel by sources with the creature type Demon or the creature type Dragon is prevented. -- Baneslayer Angel can\'t be enchanted by Auras or equipped by artifacts that have somehow gotten the creature type Demon or the creature type Dragon."}]', "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'A copy’s controller can’t choose to pay any additional costs for the copy. However, effects based on any additional costs that were paid for the original spell are copied as though those same costs were paid for the copy too.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'Each copy will have the same targets as the spell it’s copying unless its controller chooses new ones. That player may change any number of the targets, including all of them or none of them. If, for one of the targets, the player can’t choose a new legal target, then it remains unchanged (even if the current target is illegal).'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'Hive Mind will copy any instant or sorcery spell, not just one with targets.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'Hive Mind’s effect is mandatory. Each other player must copy the spell whether they want to or not.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If a copy says that it affects “you,” it affects the controller of the copy, not the controller of the original spell. Similarly, if a copy says that it affects an “opponent,” it affects an opponent of the copy’s controller, not an opponent of the original spell’s controller.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If a player casts an instant or sorcery spell, Hive Mind’s ability triggers and is put on the stack on top of that spell. Hive Mind’s ability will resolve first. When it does, it creates a number of copies of that spell equal to the number of players in the game minus one. First the player whose turn it is (or, if that’s the player who cast the original spell, the player to that player’s left) puts their copy on the stack, choosing new targets for it if they like. Then each other player in turn order does the same. The last copy put on the stack will be the first one that resolves. (Note that the very last thing to happen is that the original spell resolves.)'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If the spell that’s copied has an X whose value was determined as it was cast (like Earthquake does), the copy has the same value of X.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If the spell that’s copied is modal (that is, it says “Choose one —” or the like), the copy will have the same mode. A player can’t choose a different one.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'The copies that Hive Mind’s ability creates are created on the stack, so they’re not “cast.” Abilities that trigger when a player casts a spell (like Hive Mind’s ability itself) won’t trigger.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'A creature with power 0 or less assigns no combat damage. (It doesn’t assign a negative amount of combat damage.)'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': \'A “blocking creature” is one that has been declared as a blocker this combat, or one that was put onto the battlefield blocking this combat. Unless that creature leaves combat, it continues to be a blocking creature through the end of combat step, even if the creature or creatures it was blocking are no longer on the battlefield or have otherwise left combat.\'}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': \'An “attacking creature” is one that has been declared as an attacker this combat, or one that was put onto the battlefield attacking this combat. Unless that creature leaves combat, it continues to be an attacking creature through the end of combat step, even if the player it was attacking has left the game, or the planeswalker it was attacking has left combat.\'}, {\'date\': \'2012-07-01\', \'text\': "Destroying a blocking creature won\'t cause any of the creatures it was blocking to become unblocked. They won\'t deal combat damage to the defending player or planeswalker (unless they have trample)."}]', "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'A “blocking creature” is one that has been declared as a blocker this combat, or one that was put onto the battlefield blocking this combat. Unless that creature leaves combat, it continues to be a blocking creature through the end of combat step, even if the creature or creatures it was blocking are no longer on the battlefield or have otherwise left combat.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'A “creature card” is any card with the type creature, even if it has other types such as artifact, enchantment, or land. Older cards of type summon are also creature cards.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'After the player names a card, check if the card you chose has that name. If it doesn’t, but it’s a creature card, you may put it onto the battlefield. If you don’t want to put that card onto the battlefield, it’s not a creature card, or it does have the name the player said, it simply stays in that player’s library without ever being revealed. The player then shuffles their library, including that card.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'Once you’ve chosen a card during your search, you must clearly indicate which card you’ve chosen (preferably without showing the front of that card to the player!). Then the player names a card.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'You may search for any card, not just a creature card. Of course, if you choose a noncreature card, you won’t be able to put it onto the battlefield no matter what card the player names.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'A “creature card” is any card with the type creature, even if it has other types such as artifact, enchantment, or land. Older cards of type summon are also creature cards.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If an opponent casts a spell, this ability triggers and is put on the stack on top of that spell. This ability will resolve (meaning that a revealed creature card will enter the battlefield) before the spell resolves.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'You must put the revealed card onto the battlefield if it’s a creature card. If it’s not a creature card and you don’t put it on the bottom of your library, it stops being revealed and simply remains on top of your library.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'A “creature card” is any card with the type creature, even if it has other types such as artifact, enchantment, or land. Older cards of type summon are also creature cards.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'A “creature spell” is any spell with the type creature, even if it has other types such as artifact or enchantment. Older cards of type summon are also creature spells.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'Activating the ability during your opponent’s turn after attackers have been declared will have no effect. The same is true if you activate the ability during your own turn.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'After the ability resolves, the targeted creature attacks you only if it’s able to do so as that turn’s declare attackers step begins. If, at that time, the creature is tapped, is affected by a spell or ability that says it can’t attack, or is affected by “summoning sickness,” it can’t attack. If there’s a cost associated with having that creature attack, its controller isn’t forced to pay that cost, so the creature doesn’t have to attack in that case either.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If the targeted creature would be able to attack either you or a planeswalker you control, it must attack you, not the planeswalker.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'After Harm’s Way resolves, it no longer checks to see if the target is a legal target. However, if that permanent or player can’t be dealt damage at the time the chosen source would deal damage (perhaps because the creature is no longer on the battlefield or is no longer a creature, or because the player is no longer in the game), the damage can’t be redirected. It’s dealt to the original recipient.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'As you cast Harm’s Way, you target that the redirected damage will be dealt to. As Harm’s Way resolves, you choose a source of damage. You never choose the original recipient of the damage; Harm’s Way will apply to whatever the chosen source tries to deal damage to, as long as it’s you or a permanent you control.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'Harm’s Way has no effect on damage that’s already been dealt.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If the chosen source would deal just 1 damage to you or a permanent you control, Harm’s Way’s effect will redirect that damage and still have a “shield” left for another 1 damage from that source later in the turn.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If the chosen source would simultaneously deal damage to multiple permanents you control (like Pyroclasm could) or to you and at least one permanent you control (like Earthquake could), Harm’s Way will redirect just 2 of that damage. It won’t redirect the next 2 damage that would be dealt to each recipient. You choose which 2 damage is redirected. If you like, you can choose to redirect 1 damage that would be dealt by the chosen source to each of two different recipients.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'All damage that would be dealt to Protean Hydra is prevented, even if it doesn’t have that many +1/+1 counters on it. This is true even if Protean Hydra has no +1/+1 counters on it at all (and is able to remain on the battlefield because some other effect is boosting its toughness). If the amount of damage that would be dealt to Protean Hydra is greater than the number of +1/+1 counters on it, all the +1/+1 counters on Protean Hydra are removed from it.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If a -1/-1 counter is put on Protean Hydra while it has +1/+1 counters on it, that -1/-1 counter and a +1/+1 counter will be removed from it as a state-based action. This will cause Protean Hydra’s last ability to trigger.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If any +1/+1 counters are removed from Protean Hydra during the end step, its last ability will trigger and set up a delayed triggered ability that will trigger at the beginning of the next end step (which is near the end of the following turn).'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If multiple +1/+1 counters are removed from Protean Hydra at once, its last ability will trigger that many times.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If unpreventable damage is dealt to Protean Hydra, the Hydra’s second ability will try to prevent it and fail (meaning that damage has its normal results), and it will also remove that many +1/+1 counters from Protean Hydra.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'Protean Hydra’s last ability triggers whenever a +1/+1 counter is removed from it for any reason, not just when a +1/+1 counter is removed by its second ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'Although the reminder text doesn’t say so, Great Sable Stag also can’t be equipped by blue or black Equipment.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'Great Sable Stag can be targeted by spells that try to counter it (such as Cancel). Those spells will resolve, but the part of their effect that would counter Great Sable Stag won’t do anything. Any other effects those spells have will work as normal.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': \'An "attacking creature" is one that has been declared as an attacker this combat, or one that was put onto the battlefield attacking this combat. Unless that creature leaves combat, it continues to be an attacking creature through the end of combat step, even if the player it was attacking has left the game, or the planeswalker it was attacking has left combat.\'}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': \'Even though Trumpet Blast affects only attacking creatures, the bonus will remain for the rest of the turn.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': "Only creatures that are attacking as Trumpet Blast resolves will receive the bonus. In other words, casting it before you\'ve declared attackers usually won\'t do anything."}]', "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'An effect may put Jackal Familiar onto the battlefield attacking even if no other creatures are attacking. That’s because it wasn’t declared as an attacker in this case. Similarly, an effect may put Jackal Familiar onto the battlefield blocking even if no other creatures are blocking.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'Once Jackal Familiar has been legally declared as an attacking or blocking creature, how many other creatures it’s attacking or blocking with no longer matters. For example, if Jackal Familiar and Canyon Minotaur both attack, then Canyon Minotaur leaves the battlefield, Jackal Familiar continues to attack even though it’s now attacking alone.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': '“Can’t attack alone” means Jackal Familiar can’t be declared as an attacker during the declare attackers step unless at least one other creature is also declared as an attacker at that time (either by you or your Two-Headed Giant teammate).'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': '“Can’t block alone” has a similar meaning. Note that the other blocker(s) doesn’t have to block the same attacker as Jackal Familiar.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'As the ability resolves, there is no time to react between the time a permanent is chosen at random and the time it’s destroyed. If you want to put a regeneration shield on one of those permanents, or sacrifice it for some effect, or anything else, you must do so before the ability resolves (and before you know which one of the permanents will be chosen at random).'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If Capricious Efreet is the only nonland permanent you control when its ability triggers, you’ll have to target it.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'You may target zero, one, or two nonland permanents you don’t control.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'You target between one and three permanents as you put the ability on the stack. You don’t randomly choose which one will be destroyed until the ability resolves. If one of those permanents has become an illegal target by then, you randomly choose between the remaining ones.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'Awakener Druid’s ability affects a land with the land type Forest, not necessarily a land with the name Forest.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'Awakener Druid’s ability is mandatory. When it enters the battlefield, you must target a Forest (if there is one), even if you don’t control that Forest.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If Awakener Druid and the Treefolk are dealt lethal damage at the same time, both will be destroyed. However, if Awakener Druid leaves the battlefield before the Treefolk is dealt damage, it will immediately revert to being just a land and thus can’t be dealt damage.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If Awakener Druid leaves the battlefield before its enters-the-battlefield ability resolves, nothing happens to the targeted Forest when that ability resolves. It won’t become a creature.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If the targeted Forest entered the battlefield this turn, it will be affected by “summoning sickness” once it becomes a Treefolk. You won’t be able to attack with it or use its activated abilities that have {T} in the cost (including its mana ability).'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'Burst of Speed affects only creatures you control at the time it resolves. It won’t affect creatures that come under your control later in the turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'Captain of the Watch grants +1/+1 and vigilance to all other Soldier creatures you control, not just the ones its ability puts onto the battlefield.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': \'Cemetery Reaper grants +1/+1 to all other Zombie creatures you control, not just the ones its ability puts onto the battlefield.\'}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "The creature card in a graveyard is exiled as part of the activated ability\'s effect, not as a cost. If that card has left the graveyard by the time the ability would resolve, the ability doesn\'t resolve and you don\'t get a Zombie token."}]', "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'Combat damage is the damage that’s dealt automatically by attacking and blocking creatures, even if it’s redirected (by Harm’s Way, perhaps). Noncombat damage is any other damage (generally, it’s damage dealt as the result of a spell or ability).'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'Magebane Armor can equip a creature that doesn’t have flying. The “lose flying” effect just won’t do anything in that case.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'Magebane Armor causes the equipped creature to lose flying at the time it became equipped. Any ability that grants that creature flying that starts to work later (such as a Jump that resolves later, or a Levitation that comes under your control later) will work normally.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'Each player must discard three cards, even a player that (for some reason) didn’t actually draw three cards.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'First the player whose turn it is draws three cards, then each other player in turn order does so. Then the active player randomly chooses the three cards they will discard, then each other player in turn order does so. Then all the cards are discarded at the same time.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'Entangling Vines can enchant only a creature that’s tapped. If at any time the enchanted creature is untapped, Entangling Vines is put into its owner’s graveyard as a state-based action.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If Entangling Vines is cast as a spell, it can target only a tapped creature. If the creature has become untapped by the time Entangling Vines would resolve, it’s countered and put into its owner’s graveyard from the stack.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'Exiled cards are face up by default; they’re face down only if the effect that exiled them said so. For example, the cards from your library that Mirror of Fate exiles are exiled face up.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'You choose the order that the chosen cards are put on top of your library. You don’t have to show anyone else that order.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'You don’t choose the exiled cards until Mirror of Fate’s ability resolves. It doesn’t matter how they wound up in the exile zone.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'First the opponent whose turn it is — or, more likely, the first opponent to left of the player whose turn it is — chooses and announces which land they will sacrifice, then each other opponent in turn order does the same, then all lands are sacrificed at the same time.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'Glorious Charge affects only creatures you control at the time it resolves. It won’t affect creatures that come under your control later in the turn. It won’t affect permanents that become creatures later in the turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If Illusionary Servant becomes the target of a spell or ability, Illusionary Servant’s ability triggers and is put on the stack on top of that spell or ability. Illusionary Servant’s ability will resolve (causing it to be sacrificed) first. Unless the spell or ability has another target, it will then be countered when it tries to resolve for having no legal targets.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If a player casts a black spell, Demon’s Horn’s ability triggers and is put on the stack on top of that spell. Demon’s Horn’s ability will resolve (causing you to gain 1 life) before the spell does.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'The ability triggers whenever any player, not just you, casts a black spell.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If a player casts a blue spell, Kraken’s Eye’s ability triggers and is put on the stack on top of that spell. Kraken’s Eye’s ability will resolve (causing you to gain 1 life) before the spell does.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'The ability triggers whenever any player, not just you, casts a blue spell.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If a player casts a green spell, Wurm’s Tooth’s ability triggers and is put on the stack on top of that spell. Wurm’s Tooth’s ability will resolve (causing you to gain 1 life) before the spell does.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'The ability triggers whenever any player, not just you, casts a green spell.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If a player casts a red spell, Dragon’s Claw’s ability triggers and is put on the stack on top of that spell. Dragon’s Claw’s ability will resolve (causing you to gain 1 life) before the spell does.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'The ability triggers whenever any player, not just you, casts a red spell.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If a player casts a white spell, Angel’s Feather’s ability triggers and is put on the stack on top of that spell. Angel’s Feather’s ability will resolve (causing you to gain 1 life) before the spell does.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'The ability triggers whenever any player, not just you, casts a white spell.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If an effect would simultaneously destroy Indestructibility and the creature it’s enchanting, only Indestructibility is destroyed.'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'If a creature enchanted by Indestructibility is dealt lethal damage, the creature isn’t destroyed, but the damage remains marked on the creature. If Indestructibility stops enchanting that creature later in the turn, the creature will no longer have indestructible and will be destroyed.'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'Lethal damage, damage from a source with deathtouch, and effects that say “destroy” won’t cause a permanent with indestructible to be put into the graveyard. However, a permanent with indestructible can be put into the graveyard for a number of reasons. The most likely reasons are if it’s sacrificed, if it’s legendary and another legendary permanent with the same name is controlled by the same player, if it’s a planeswalker and another planeswalker with the same subtype is controlled by the same player, if it’s a creature with toughness 0 or less, or if it’s an Aura that’s either unattached or attached to something illegal.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If an opponent casts a blue or black spell, Mold Adder’s ability triggers and is put on the stack on top of that spell. Mold Adder’s ability will resolve before the spell does.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If an opponent casts a spell that’s both blue and black, Mold Adder’s ability triggers only once.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If multiple effects modify your hand size, apply them in timestamp order. For example, if you put Null Profusion (an enchantment that says your maximum hand size is two) onto the battlefield and then put Spellbook onto the battlefield, you’ll have no maximum hand size. However, if those permanents entered the battlefield in the opposite order, your maximum hand size would be two.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If the enchanted creature becomes the target of a spell or ability, Ice Cage’s ability triggers and is put on the stack on top of that spell or ability. Ice Cage’s ability will resolve (causing Ice Cage to be destroyed) first.'}, {'date': '2016-06-08', 'text': 'Activated abilities contain a colon. They’re generally written “[Cost]: [Effect].” Some keywords are activated abilities and will have colons in their reminder text.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If the targeted permanent is an illegal target by the time Solemn Offering would resolve, the entire spell doesn’t resolve. You won’t gain any life.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If the targeted permanent or player is an illegal target by the time Consume Spirit would resolve, the entire spell doesn’t resolve. You won’t gain any life.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'The amount of life you gain is equal to the number chosen for X, not the amount of damage Consume Spirit deals (in case some of it is prevented).'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If the targeted permanent or player is an illegal target by the time Goblin Artillery’s ability would resolve, the entire ability doesn’t resolve. You won’t be dealt any damage.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If there are fewer than five cards in the targeted player’s library, that player puts all the cards from their library into their graveyard.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If there are fewer than twenty cards in the targeted player’s library, that player puts all the cards from their library into their graveyard.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If you have two Xathrid Demons, both abilities will trigger at the beginning of your upkeep. When the first Demon’s ability resolves, you can sacrifice the second Demon to satisfy the requirement (“Sacrifice a creature other than Xathrid Demon” really means “Sacrifice a creature other than this creature”). When the second Demon’s ability resolves, you must sacrifice another creature. If you can’t (because the first Demon has somehow left the battlefield and you control no other creatures), you lose 7 life, regardless of whether the second Demon is still on the battlefield at this time.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'When the ability resolves, if you control any other creatures, you must sacrifice one of them. You lose life only if no creature can be sacrificed.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If you sacrifice an attacking or blocking creature during the declare blockers step, it won’t deal combat damage. If you wait until the combat damage step, but that creature has been dealt lethal damage, it’ll be destroyed before you get a chance to sacrifice it.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'You can sacrifice Vampire Aristocrat to activate its own ability, but it won’t be around to get the bonus.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'Inferno Elemental’s ability resolves during the declare blockers step, before even first strike damage is assigned. If the damage dealt to another creature this way is lethal damage, that creature will be destroyed before it can deal its combat damage.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'Inferno Elemental’s ability will trigger for each creature it blocks or becomes blocked by.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'The 3 damage that Inferno Elemental deals as a result of its ability is not combat damage. Inferno Elemental will still deal its combat damage as normal (unless all the creatures that blocked or were blocked by it have left the battlefield by the time the combat damage step begins).'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'Lands are colorless (even if their frames have some colored elements to them). You can’t target a Swamp, a Mountain, or any other land with Celestial Purge (unless some other effect has turned that land black or red).'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'Lands are colorless (even if their frames have some colored elements to them). You can’t target a Swamp, a Mountain, or any other land with Lightwielder Paladin’s ability (unless some other effect has turned that land black or red).'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'Overrun affects only creatures you control at the time it resolves. It won’t affect creatures that come under your control later in the turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'Safe Passage doesn’t prevent damage that would be dealt to planeswalkers you control.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'Safe Passage has no effect on damage that’s already been dealt.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'Safe Passage prevents all damage, not just combat damage, that would be dealt to you and creatures you control this turn.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'Safe Passage will prevent damage dealt to creatures that weren’t on the battlefield at the time it resolved.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'Spells and permanents have controllers, but cards that aren’t on the stack or the battlefield don’t. If a source without a controller (such as a cycled Jund Sojourners, for example) would deal damage to you, 1 of that damage is prevented if an opponent owns that source.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'The effects from multiple Guardian Seraphs are cumulative.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'This ability prevents 1 damage from each source an opponent controls each time that source would deal damage to you. It prevents 1 of any damage, not just combat damage.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'The ability affects whichever creature is enchanted by Firebreathing at the time the ability resolves. The bonus remains even if Firebreathing stops enchanting that creature.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'This ability can be activated by Firebreathing’s controller, not the enchanted creature’s controller (in case they’re different players).'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'The affected land loses its existing land types and any abilities printed on it. It becomes the chosen basic land type and now has the ability to tap to add one mana of the appropriate color to your mana pool. Convincing Mirage’s ability doesn’t change the affected land’s name or whether it’s legendary or basic.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'The controller of the enchanted creature, not the controller of Lifelink, gains the life (in case they’re different players).'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'The first ability can target any two lands. They don’t have to be tapped.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'The third ability affects only creatures you control at the time it resolves. It won’t affect creatures that come under your control later in the turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'This ability counts the number of Plains controlled by Armored Ascension’s controller, not the enchanted creature’s controller (in case they’re different players).'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'This bonus is not fixed; it changes as the number of Plains you control changes.'}, {'date': '2010-08-15', 'text': 'The ability cares about lands with the land type Plains, not necessarily lands named Plains.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'To work as an evasion ability, an attacking creature must already have flying when the declare blockers step begins. Once a creature has become blocked, giving it flying won’t change that.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If the top card of your library changes while you’re casting a spell or activating an ability, the new top card won’t be revealed until you finish casting that spell or activating that ability.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'The top card of your library isn’t in your hand, so you can’t suspend it, cycle it, discard it, or activate any of its activated abilities.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'When playing with the top card of your library revealed, if an effect tells you to draw several cards, reveal each one before you draw it.'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'If the top card of your library is black, Vampire Nocturnus will give itself +2/+1 and flying even if it’s somehow not a Vampire.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'To work as an evasion ability, an attacking creature must already have flying when the declare blockers step begins. Once a creature has become blocked, giving it flying won’t change that.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'Undead Slayer’s ability must target a permanent (not a card in the graveyard) with at least one of the listed creature types.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'While you’re searching the player’s library, you don’t have to find all the cards with the same name as an exiled card if you don’t want to. You can leave any number of them in that player’s library.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-08-15', 'text': 'Activating Cudgel Troll’s ability causes a “regeneration shield” to be created for it. The next time Cudgel Troll would be destroyed that turn, the regeneration shield is used up instead. This works only if Cudgel Troll is dealt lethal damage, dealt damage from a source with deathtouch, or affected by a spell or ability that says to “destroy” it. Other effects that cause Cudgel Troll to be put into the graveyard (such as reducing its toughness to 0 or sacrificing it) don’t destroy it, so regeneration won’t save it. If it hasn’t been used, the regeneration shield goes away as the turn ends.'}, {'date': '2010-08-15', 'text': 'If Cudgel Troll is dealt lethal damage and is dealt damage by a source with deathtouch during the same combat damage step, a single regeneration shield will save it.'}, {'date': '2010-08-15', 'text': 'To work, the regeneration shield must be created before Cudgel Troll is destroyed. This usually means activating its ability during the declare blockers step, or in response to a spell or ability that would destroy it.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-08-15', 'text': 'Gaining control of a creature doesn’t cause you gain control of any Auras or Equipment attached to it.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-08-15', 'text': 'If, during your declare attackers step, Berserkers of Blood Ridge is tapped, is affected by a spell or ability that says it can’t attack, or is affected by “summoning sickness,” then it doesn’t attack. If there’s a cost associated with having Berserkers of Blood Ridge attack, you aren’t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn’t have to attack in that case either.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2012-07-01\', \'text\': "Giving a creature first strike after creatures with first strike deal combat damage doesn\'t prevent that creature from dealing combat damage."}]', "[{'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'Howl of the Night Pack counts any land you control with the subtype Forest, not just ones named Forest.'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'The number of Wolves you put onto the battlefield is based on the number of Forests you control when Howl of the Night Pack resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'Lethal damage, damage from a source with deathtouch, and effects that say “destroy” won’t cause a creature with indestructible to be put into the graveyard. However, a creature with indestructible can be put into the graveyard for a number of reasons. The most likely reasons are if it’s sacrificed or if its toughness is 0 or less. (In these cases, of course, Darksteel Colossus would be shuffled into its owner’s library instead of being put into its owner’s graveyard.)'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'If the creature isn’t tapped during its controller’s next untap step (perhaps because it was untapped by a spell), Wall of Frost’s ability has no effect at that time. It won’t try to keep the creature tapped on subsequent turns.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Wall of Frost’s ability tracks the creature, not the creature’s controller. That is, if the creature changes controllers before its first controller’s next untap step, then it won’t untap during its new controller’s next untap step.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "Fireball\'s damage is divided as Fireball resolves, not as it\'s cast, because there are no choices involved. The division involves only targets that are still legal as Fireball resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': \'For example, if X is 5 and you choose three target creatures, Fireball has a total cost of {7}{R} (even though its mana cost is just {5}{R} and its mana value is 6). If those creatures are all still legal targets as Fireball resolves, it deals 1 damage to each of them.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': \'You can target more than X creatures. However, if the number of legal targets at the time Fireball resolves is greater than X, none of them will be dealt any damage.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': \'You may cast Fireball with zero targets, regardless of the value chosen for X. If you do so, it will not be a targeted spell, and no damage will actually be dealt when it resolves.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "If some of the creatures or players are illegal targets as Bogardan Hellkite\'s triggered ability tries to resolve, the original division of damage still applies and the damage that would have been dealt to the illegal targets is lost. It won\'t be dealt instead to a legal target."}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "You choose how many targets Bogardan Hellkite\'s triggered ability has and how the damage is divided as you put the ability onto the stack. Each target must receive at least 1 damage."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "All Wolves you control are tapped as part of the activated ability\'s effect, not as a cost. Players may respond by attempting to tap or untap Wolves, or to create or remove them."}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Master of the Wild Hunt\'s ability tries to resolve, the ability doesn\'t resolve. You won\'t tap your Wolves, and nothing will deal or be dealt damage."}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "Only a Wolf creature tapped as part of the ability\'s effect can be dealt damage by the target creature."}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "The controller of the target creature doesn\'t divide that creature\'s damage as the ability is activated (since the Wolves that will receive that damage aren\'t targeted), so that player does so as the ability resolves. There is no time to react between the time a Wolf is chosen, the time damage is dealt to it, and the time it\'s destroyed for having been dealt lethal damage. If you want to put a regeneration shield on one of those Wolves, or target it with a damage-prevention spell, or anything else, you must do so before the ability resolves (and before you know which Wolves will be chosen and how much damage will be dealt to them)."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "You can\'t do anything in between drawing a card and discarding a card, including casting or cycling the card you drew."}]', "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'A later effect that changes the affected creature’s colors will overwrite that part of Rise from the Grave’s effect; the creature will be only the new color. The same is true about an effect that changes the affected creature’s types or subtypes.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If the creature is normally colorless, it will simply become black. It can’t be both black and colorless.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Rise from the Grave doesn’t overwrite any previous colors or types. Rather, it adds another color and another subtype.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If a spell has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If the revealed card is a land, you can play it only if it’s your turn and you haven’t yet played a land this turn.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If you cast a spell “without paying its mana cost,” you can’t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs, such as kicker costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, such as that of Tormenting Voice, those must be paid to cast the card.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If you wish to play the exiled card, you must play it while the last ability of Djinn of Wishes is resolving. You can’t play it later in the turn. A spell cast this way may be cast at a time you normally wouldn’t be able to cast a spell of that type, but other restrictions (such as “Cast this spell only during combat”) are enforced.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'The second part of Sleep’s ability affects all creatures the targeted player controls as Sleep resolves, not only the ones that Sleep actually caused to become tapped.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2019-07-12\', \'text\': "Act of Treason can target any creature, even one that\'s untapped or one you already control."}, {\'date\': \'2019-07-12\', \'text\': "Gaining control of a creature doesn\'t cause you to gain control of any Auras or Equipment attached to it."}]', "[{'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'If a creature the defending player controls can’t block Prized Unicorn for any reason (such as being tapped), then it doesn’t block Prized Unicorn. If there’s a cost associated with having a creature block Prized Unicorn, the defending player isn’t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn’t have to block.'}, {'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'If more than one Prized Unicorn is attacking, creatures that could block must block one Prized Unicorn, but they don’t all have to block the same Prized Unicorn.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "An Aura put onto the battlefield this way can\'t enchant an artifact or enchantment that\'s also being put onto the battlefield with Open the Vaults."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "If an Aura can be returned to the battlefield with Open the Vaults, it must be, even if its owner doesn\'t like what it would enchant."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "If an Aura is put onto the battlefield without being cast, the Aura\'s controller-to-be chooses what it will enchant as it enters the battlefield. An Aura put onto the battlefield this way doesn\'t target anything (so it could be attached to an opponent\'s permanent with hexproof, for example), but the Aura\'s enchant ability restricts what it can be attached to. If the Aura can\'t legally be attached to anything, it remains in its current zone."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'If multiple players have Auras in their graveyards, the player whose turn it is announces what their Auras will enchant, then each other player in turn order does the same, then all artifacts and enchantments (including both Auras and non-Auras) enter the battlefield at the same time.\'}]', "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'A player who can’t cast a spell can’t suspend a card.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Silence won’t affect spells that your opponents cast before you cast Silence, including any spells that are still on the stack. Silence also won’t stop your opponents from casting spells after you cast Silence but before Silence resolves.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'The only thing Silence stops is casting spells. Your opponents can still activate abilities, including abilities of cards in their hands (like cycling). Their triggered abilities work as normal, they can still play lands, and so on.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'Because damage remains marked on a creature until the damage is removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to one Relentless Rats may become lethal if another Relentless Rats leaves the battlefield during that turn.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'The last ability of Relentless Rats lets you ignore the "four-of" rule. It doesn\\\'t let you ignore format legality. For example, during a Time Spiral Remastered Limited event, you can\\\'t add Relentless Rats from your personal collection.\'}]', "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Tendrils of Corruption tries to resolve, the spell doesn’t resolve. You don’t gain X life.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If you choose to shuffle your library, that includes the three cards you just looked at and put back on top of it.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-09-09', 'text': 'If the fourth (or more) time Dragon Whelp’s ability is activated during the same turn happens to be during that turn’s end step, the delayed triggered ability won’t trigger until the beginning of the next turn’s end step. You’ll have to sacrifice Dragon Whelp at that time.'}, {'date': '2022-09-09', 'text': 'The first three times Dragon Whelp’s ability is activated in a turn will do nothing other than give it +1/+0 until end of turn. Any subsequent activations will also cause its delayed triggered ability to trigger. That means if you activate Dragon Whelp’s ability five times, for example, two different delayed triggered abilities will trigger at the beginning of the next end step and cause you to sacrifice Dragon Whelp.'}, {'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'If the fourth (or subsequent) time Dragon Whelp’s ability is activated during the same turn is during that turn’s end step, the delayed triggered ability won’t trigger until the beginning of the next turn’s end step. You’ll have to sacrifice Dragon Whelp at that time.'}, {'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'There’s no limit to the number of times you can activate Dragon Whelp’s ability in a turn. However, the fourth activation in a turn and each subsequent activation will cause a delayed triggered ability that will force you to sacrifice Dragon Whelp at the beginning of the next end step.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2022-12-08\', \'text\': "You can sacrifice any Goblin you control to activate Siege-Gang Commander\'s activated ability, including Siege-Gang Commander itself."}]', "[{'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'Enchantments put onto the battlefield without being cast won’t cause Mesa Enchantress’s ability to trigger.'}, {'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'If the enchantment spell is countered, Mesa Enchantress’s ability still resolves and causes you to draw a card.'}, {'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'Mesa Enchantress’s ability will resolve before the spell that caused it to trigger.'}]"]
foreign_names: ["[{'name': 'Abbrechen', 'text': 'Neutralisiere einen Zauberspruch deiner Wahl.', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199599&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e051ddbe-5ce5-40f4-afe9-3647368d5f20', 'multiverseId': 199599}, 'multiverseid': 199599}, {'name': 'Deshacer', 'text': 'Contrarresta el hechizo objetivo.', 'type': 'Instantáneo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200595&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9fb2ed41-1022-41aa-89f0-ee2b6deef0bc', 'multiverseId': 200595}, 'multiverseid': 200595}, {'name': 'Révocation', 'text': 'Contrecarrez le sort ciblé.', 'type': 'Éphémère', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199350&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '248ba327-9e83-46e8-8c29-e4cdcb631f49', 'multiverseId': 199350}, 'multiverseid': 199350}, {'name': 'Eliminare', 'text': 'Neutralizza una magia bersaglio.', 'type': 'Istantaneo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200346&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd97f1423-fcf3-458f-8fac-85cef24f71ab', 'multiverseId': 200346}, 'multiverseid': 200346}, {'name': '取り消し', 'text': '呪文１つを対象とし、それを打ち消す。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199848&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '61e9332e-7b55-48c7-a419-0931f38f8ce2', 'multiverseId': 199848}, 'multiverseid': 199848}, {'name': 'Cancelar', 'text': 'Anule a mágica alvo.', 'type': 'Mágica Instantânea', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199101&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dd2b172b-335e-4bb9-b4f3-bb1cd611ffa7', 'multiverseId': 199101}, 'multiverseid': 199101}, {'name': 'Отмена', 'text': 'Отмените целевое заклинание.', 'type': 'Мгновенное заклинание', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200097&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7850f0bb-7456-46ff-98db-8fa652d85287', 'multiverseId': 200097}, 'multiverseid': 200097}, {'name': '取消', 'text': '反击目标咒语。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200844&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '61eb65f6-30c1-41e8-9265-8017a533bb17', 'multiverseId': 200844}, 'multiverseid': 200844}]", '[{\'name\': \'Ajani Goldmähne\', \'text\': \'+1: Du erhältst 2 Lebenspunkte dazu.\\n-1: Lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf jede Kreatur, die du kontrollierst. Diese Kreaturen erhalten Wachsamkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\n-6: Bringe einen weißen Avatar-Kreaturenspielstein mit „Stärke und Widerstandskraft dieser Kreatur sind gleich der Anzahl deiner Lebenspunkte" ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Ajani\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199556&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56f01d86-38a7-4264-812e-3ab02ddaaffa\', \'multiverseId\': 199556}, \'multiverseid\': 199556}, {\'name\': \'Ajani Melena Dorada\', \'text\': \'+1: Gana 2 vidas.\\n-1: Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre cada criatura que controlas. Esas criaturas ganan la habilidad de vigilancia hasta el final del turno.\\n-6: Pon en el campo de batalla una ficha de criatura Avatar blanca con "La fuerza y la resistencia de esta criatura son iguales a tu total de vidas".\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Ajani\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200552&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec1c645a-9611-46ea-8110-db54cb9cd329\', \'multiverseId\': 200552}, \'multiverseid\': 200552}, {\'name\': \'Ajani Crinièredor\', \'text\': "+1 : Vous gagnez 2 points de vie.\\n-1 : Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur chaque créature que vous contrôlez. Ces créatures acquièrent la vigilance jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\n-6 : Mettez sur le champ de bataille un jeton de créature blanche Avatar avec « La force et l\'endurance de cette créature sont chacune égale à votre total de points de vie. »", \'type\': \'Planeswalker : Ajani\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199307&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb8436e5-331d-4419-b186-38abcb47f443\', \'multiverseId\': 199307}, \'multiverseid\': 199307}, {\'name\': "Ajani Criniera D\'Oro", \'text\': \'+1: Guadagni 2 punti vita.\\n-1: Metti un segnalino +1/+1 su ogni creatura che controlli. Quelle creature hanno cautela fino alla fine del turno.\\n-6: Metti sul campo di battaglia una pedina creatura Avatar bianca con "La forza e la costituzione di questa creatura sono pari ai tuoi punti vita".\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Ajani\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200303&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81ac222f-84ec-4b2d-aa63-4112da062846\', \'multiverseId\': 200303}, \'multiverseid\': 200303}, {\'name\': \'黄金のたてがみのアジャニ\', \'text\': \'+1：あなたは２点のライフを得る。\\n-1：あなたがコントロールする各クリーチャーの上に、それぞれ＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。 それらのクリーチャーはターン終了時まで警戒を得る。\\n-6：「このクリーチャーのパワーとタフネスは、それぞれあなたのライフの総量に等しい。」を持つ白のアバター・クリーチャー・トークンを１体戦場に出す。\', \'type\': \'プレインズウォーカー — アジャニ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199805&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0cacead-c272-4ed6-9618-e8870925dcfd\', \'multiverseId\': 199805}, \'multiverseid\': 199805}, {\'name\': "Ajani Juba D\'ouro", \'text\': \'+1: Você ganha 2 pontos de vida.\\n-1: Coloque um marcador +1/+1 sobre cada criatura que você controla. Aquelas criaturas ganham vigilância até o final do turno.\\n-6: Coloque no campo de batalha uma ficha de criatura branca do tipo Avatar com "O poder e a resistência desta criatura são ambos iguais ao seu total de pontos de vida".\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Ajani\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199058&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0d8f256-3fbc-4689-b667-ac90bcbe8ccc\', \'multiverseId\': 199058}, \'multiverseid\': 199058}, {\'name\': \'Златогривый Аджани\', \'text\': \'+1: вы получаете 2 жизни.\\n-1: положите жетон +1/+1 на каждое существо под вашим контролем. Те существа получают Бдительность до конца хода.\\n-6: положите на поле битвы одну фишку существа белая Аватара со способностью «Сила и выносливость этого существа равны количеству ваших жизней».\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Аджани\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200054&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'359c4c2e-fb66-4222-875f-4096fe459021\', \'multiverseId\': 200054}, \'multiverseid\': 200054}, {\'name\': \'金鬃阿耶尼\', \'text\': \'+1：你获得2点生命。\\n-1：在每个由你操控的生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物。 这些生物获得警戒异能直到回合结束。\\n-6：将一个白色，具有「此生物的力量和防御力各等同于你的总生命」的圣者衍生物放进战场。\', \'type\': \'鹏洛客～阿耶尼\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200801&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20cc32f1-58b7-46d5-bb39-2211d6c67b94\', \'multiverseId\': 200801}, \'multiverseid\': 200801}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ameisenkönigin\', \'text\': \'{1}{G}: Bringe einen 1/1 grünen Insekt-Kreaturenspielstein ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Insekt\', \'flavor\': \'„Töte die Königin zuerst, sonst haben wir die ganze Zeit ihre Soldaten am Hals. Wie immer kann so eine Königin gar nicht genug Diener um sich scharen." —Borzard, Hauptmann der Schädlingsbekämpfer\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199721&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c240194a-aaf2-4d13-bc9b-c4167eac8b09\', \'multiverseId\': 199721}, \'multiverseid\': 199721}, {\'name\': \'Hormiga reina\', \'text\': \'{1}{G}: Pon en el campo de batalla una ficha de criatura Insecto verde 1/1.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Insecto\', \'flavor\': \'"Maten a la reina primero, o lucharemos contra sus zánganos para siempre. No está en la naturaleza de una reina tener suficientes sirvientes." —Borzard, capitán exterminador\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200717&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf05db8d-0354-45c2-a5f5-a609d0834436\', \'multiverseId\': 200717}, \'multiverseid\': 200717}, {\'name\': \'Reine des fourmis\', \'text\': \'{1}{G} : Mettez sur le champ de bataille un jeton de créature 1/1 verte Insecte.\', \'type\': \'Créature : insecte\', \'flavor\': "« Tuez la reine en priorité, ou ses soldats continueront d\'attaquer. Par nature, une reine n\'a jamais suffisamment de serviteurs. » —Borzard, capitaine des exterminateurs", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199472&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d19437a8-baaa-44a0-b6fc-eb14ca5c0db8\', \'multiverseId\': 199472}, \'multiverseid\': 199472}, {\'name\': \'Formica Regina\', \'text\': \'{1}{G}: Metti sul campo di battaglia una pedina creatura Insetto 1/1 verde.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Insetto\', \'flavor\': \'"Uccidete prima la regina, o dovremo combattere i suoi fuchi per sempre. Non è nella natura di una regina avere servitori a sufficienza." —Borzard, sterminatore capo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200468&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'29476f28-51f3-4c25-89c4-5b140687ffb8\', \'multiverseId\': 200468}, \'multiverseid\': 200468}, {\'name\': \'蟻の女王\', \'text\': \'{1}{G}：緑の１/１の昆虫・クリーチャー・トークンを１体戦場に出す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 昆虫\', \'flavor\': \'「まず女王を殺せ、さもなくば永遠に手下共と戦う羽目になるぞ。 配下は足りてるなんて女王なんざいるわけないんだ。」 ――駆除隊長、ボルザード\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199970&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dce9a638-4280-4124-b97f-799ca2aee38e\', \'multiverseId\': 199970}, \'multiverseid\': 199970}, {\'name\': \'Formiga Rainha\', \'text\': \'{1}{G}: Coloque no campo de batalha uma ficha de criatura verde 1/1 do tipo Inseto.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Inseto\', \'flavor\': \'"Matem primeiro a rainha, do contrário enfrentaremos seus súditos para sempre. A natureza de uma rainha é nunca ter servos suficientes." —Borzard, capitão exterminador\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199223&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'863ba1dc-9773-404e-92e4-a7a96f364663\', \'multiverseId\': 199223}, \'multiverseid\': 199223}, {\'name\': \'Муравьиная Королева\', \'text\': \'{1}{G}: положите на поле битвы одну фишку существа 1/1 зеленое Насекомое.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Насекомое\', \'flavor\': \'«Сначала убей королеву, иначе мы никогда не закончим сражаться с ее солдатами. Для королевы нет такого понятия, как слишком много слуг». — Борзард, капитан дезинсекторов\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200219&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e3a2fa3f-e143-4bc9-99f6-ec9a86714ea3\', \'multiverseId\': 200219}, \'multiverseid\': 200219}, {\'name\': \'蚁后\', \'text\': \'{1}{G}：将一个1/1绿色昆虫衍生物放进战场。\', \'type\': \'生物～昆虫\', \'flavor\': \'「先杀了蚁后，否则我们得与工蚁打个没完没了。 蚁后从来不觉得仆人够多。」 ～剿灭队长波札\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200966&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dcfd09d2-a82d-4f9a-a730-68f43ee1b4cc\', \'multiverseId\': 200966}, \'multiverseid\': 200966}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aus dem Grab holen\', \'text\': \'Bringe eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Hör auf zu jammern. Du kannst schlafen, wenn du tot bist. Oh, tut mir Leid." —Liliana Vess\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199647&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3f42c5a-8999-4683-8e21-f4b90a9611d5\', \'multiverseId\': 199647}, \'multiverseid\': 199647}, {\'name\': \'Sacar de la tumba\', \'text\': \'Regresa la carta objetivo de criatura de tu cementerio a tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Deja de quejarte. Podrás descansar cuando estés muerto. Oh, lo siento." —Liliana Vess\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200643&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'261799c0-a95e-4a7e-80b3-02c06bcaf6e3\', \'multiverseId\': 200643}, \'multiverseid\': 200643}, {\'name\': \'Défouissage\', \'text\': \'Renvoyez une carte de créature ciblée depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'« Cesse de te plaindre. Tu te reposeras quand tu seras mort. Oh — désolée. » —Liliana Vess\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199398&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9e02101-78ea-465a-91af-a6ed832570d1\', \'multiverseId\': 199398}, \'multiverseid\': 199398}, {\'name\': \'Dissotterrare\', \'text\': \'Riprendi in mano una carta creatura bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Smettila di lamentarti. Potrai riposarti quando sarai morto. Oh... scusa." —Liliana Vess\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200394&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3cdddbd6-bbac-4be8-8228-3966dbd4bbc9\', \'multiverseId\': 200394}, \'multiverseid\': 200394}, {\'name\': \'墓暴き\', \'text\': \'あなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とし、それをあなたの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「文句を言うんじゃないよ。 死んだら楽になるんだから。 っと――ごめんね。」 ――リリアナ・ヴェス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199896&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f4385822-6ef4-48b3-8015-becffa0b5573\', \'multiverseId\': 199896}, \'multiverseid\': 199896}, {\'name\': \'Desencovar\', \'text\': \'Devolva o card de criatura alvo de seu cemitério para sua mão.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Pare de reclamar. Você poderá descansar quando estiver morto. Ops! Desculpe." —Liliana Vess\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199149&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2a54ebe-0bf7-4c3e-8cc9-ca16c451d839\', \'multiverseId\': 199149}, \'multiverseid\': 199149}, {\'name\': \'Извлечение из Могилы\', \'text\': \'Верните целевую карту существа из вашего кладбища в вашу руку.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Хватит жаловаться. Отдохнешь, когда помрешь. Э-э... извини за неудачную шутку». — Лилиана Весс\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200145&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a247f5e-0b2b-47be-b5c6-793e5d3484b5\', \'multiverseId\': 200145}, \'multiverseid\': 200145}, {\'name\': \'扰坟\', \'text\': \'将目标生物牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「别抱怨了。 你死了就能休息。 啊～抱歉。」 ～莉莲娜维斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200892&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d142700b-c915-4d87-bc2d-30316c11a11f\', \'multiverseId\': 200892}, \'multiverseid\': 200892}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bannender Engel\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Erstschlag, Lebensverknüpfung, Schutz vor Dämonen, Schutz vor Drachen\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Engel\', \'flavor\': \'Einige Engel beschützen die Schwachen und Unschuldigen. Andere stöbern das Böse auf und erschlagen es.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199559&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0578d6ea-c838-4830-b348-aa29f414a796\', \'multiverseId\': 199559}, \'multiverseid\': 199559}, {\'name\': \'Ángel matademonios\', \'text\': \'Vuela, daña primero, vínculo vital, protección contra Demonios y contra Dragones.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ángel\', \'flavor\': \'Algunos ángeles protegen a los débiles e inocentes. Otros buscan y destruyen al mal donde sea que se esconda.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200555&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ecef66b-fa45-4596-9b18-0239745145b2\', \'multiverseId\': 200555}, \'multiverseid\': 200555}, {\'name\': \'Ange pourfendeur\', \'text\': \'Vol, initiative, lien de vie, protection contre les démons et protection contre les dragons\', \'type\': \'Créature : ange\', \'flavor\': "Certains anges protègent les faibles et les innocents. D\'autres traquent sans cesse le mal dans ses tanières pour le pourfendre.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199310&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4f1910a-3915-4aeb-8778-e5e412f63bbc\', \'multiverseId\': 199310}, \'multiverseid\': 199310}, {\'name\': \'Angelo Flagellatore\', \'text\': \'Volare, attacco improvviso, legame vitale, protezione da Demoni e da Draghi\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Angelo\', \'flavor\': \'Alcuni angeli proteggono gli umili e gli innocenti. Altri scovano e puniscono il male ovunque si annidi.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200306&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2652700d-3ef3-4fc1-bf64-8b3ddccad4b0\', \'multiverseId\': 200306}, \'multiverseid\': 200306}, {\'name\': \'悪斬の天使\', \'text\': \'飛行、先制攻撃、絆魂、プロテクション（デーモン）、プロテクション（ドラゴン）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 天使\', \'flavor\': \'弱く罪無き者を守る天使もいる。 あるいは、はびこる邪悪を探し滅する天使もいる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199808&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4a4ded8-9317-4858-8f0b-f8f64a6eba99\', \'multiverseId\': 199808}, \'multiverseid\': 199808}, {\'name\': \'Anjo Exterminador do Mal\', \'text\': \'Voar, iniciativa, vínculo com a vida, proteção contra demônios e dragões\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Anjo\', \'flavor\': \'Alguns anjos protegem os fracos e inocentes. Outros perseguem e destroem o mal onde quer que se esconda.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199061&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c18e262-3eec-4abd-a1e6-6e00e54fad23\', \'multiverseId\': 199061}, \'multiverseid\': 199061}, {\'name\': \'Ангел, Истребитель Зла\', \'text\': \'Полет, Первый удар, Цепь жизни, Защита от Демонов и от Драконов\', \'type\': \'Существо — Ангел\', \'flavor\': \'Одни ангелы защищают смиренных и невинных. Другие же преследуют и карают зло, где бы оно ни притаилось.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200057&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f043150-38a6-4b1e-a2f8-529807196410\', \'multiverseId\': 200057}, \'multiverseid\': 200057}, {\'name\': \'破邪天使\', \'text\': \'飞行，先攻，系命，反恶魔保护，反龙保护\', \'type\': \'生物～天使\', \'flavor\': \'有些天使负责保护弱小与无辜者。 其他的则征伐邪恶潜藏处。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200804&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45d72778-0a5f-41ca-9114-23836f7efba2\', \'multiverseId\': 200804}, \'multiverseid\': 200804}]', '[{\'name\': \'Belagerungs-Mastodon\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elefant\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Zitadelle lässt sich ganz einfach verteidigen. Ich stelle einfach diese großen Viecher vor das Haupttor und lasse die Feinde einen guten Blick auf sie werfen." —Ewald, Mastodonwärter\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199585&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d49682c-313c-4688-bec0-de7cb26bf275\', \'multiverseId\': 199585}, \'multiverseid\': 199585}, {\'name\': \'Mastodonte de asedio\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elefante\', \'flavor\': \'"Defender la ciudadela es fácil. Sólo llevo a mis amigos a la puerta principal y dejo que los enemigos les den una buena mirada." —Guardián de mastodontes\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200581&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a1e86cf-ce0d-4a0a-950a-2e5a44a34960\', \'multiverseId\': 200581}, \'multiverseid\': 200581}, {\'name\': \'Mastodonte de siège\', \'type\': \'Créature : éléphant\', \'flavor\': "« Il est facile de défendre la citadelle. Je vais juste conduire ces grands bestiaux jusqu\'à la porte principale pour être contemplés par l\'ennemi. » —Palefrin de mastodonte", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199336&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'361915df-0f6f-4fcf-8ab9-948bc8134584\', \'multiverseId\': 199336}, \'multiverseid\': 199336}, {\'name\': \'Mastodonte da Assedio\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Elefante\', \'flavor\': \'"Difendere la cittadella è facile. Porto fuori dal cancello principale questi ragazzoni e lascio che il nemico li osservi per bene." —Guardiano dei mastodonti\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200332&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1dc336f7-074e-46d5-917d-c8a3933c9f96\', \'multiverseId\': 200332}, \'multiverseid\': 200332}, {\'name\': \'包囲マストドン\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 象\', \'flavor\': \'「要塞を守るのは簡単だよ。 このでっかいのを何頭か外に連れ出して、敵さんに眺めてもらえばいいのさ。」 ――マストドンの飼育係\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199834&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4567c6fd-c68c-4495-8961-28a4e3580d20\', \'multiverseId\': 199834}, \'multiverseid\': 199834}, {\'name\': \'Mastodonte do Cerco\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elefante\', \'flavor\': \'"Defender a cidadela é fácil. Basta trazer para fora do portão principal esses bichões e deixar que o inimigo dê uma boa olhada neles." —Guardião de Mastodonte\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199087&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82c58406-4526-44b7-8679-52165541d4e0\', \'multiverseId\': 199087}, \'multiverseid\': 199087}, {\'name\': \'Осадный Мастодонт\', \'type\': \'Существо — Слон\', \'flavor\': \'«Защищать крепость легко. Я просто вывожу этих громадин за главные ворота, чтобы враг мог посмотреть на них и одуматься». — смотритель мастодонтов\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200083&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'215d96a6-dd12-4644-8313-e08726089641\', \'multiverseId\': 200083}, \'multiverseid\': 200083}, {\'name\': \'攻城乳齿象\', \'type\': \'生物～象\', \'flavor\': \'「保卫殿堂并不难。 我只要把这些大个子带出正门外，让敌人好好看个够便行。」 ～乳齿象训练人\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200830&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ce92b52-9920-4524-b3b0-53ed4b8bfbb3\', \'multiverseId\': 200830}, \'multiverseid\': 200830}]', "[{'name': 'Belagerungstrupp-Kommandant', 'text': 'Wenn der Belagerungstrupp-Kommandant ins Spiel kommt, bringe drei 1/1 rote Goblin-Kreaturenspielsteine ins Spiel.\\n{1}{R}, opfere einen Goblin: Der Belagerungstrupp-Kommandant fügt einer Kreatur oder einem Spieler deiner Wahl 2 Schadenspunkte zu.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Goblin', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199712&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1abea0e1-9519-499d-9025-98613643bcbd', 'multiverseId': 199712}, 'multiverseid': 199712}, {'name': 'Comandante de sitiadores', 'text': 'Cuando el Comandante de sitiadores entre al campo de batalla, pon tres fichas de criatura Trasgo rojas 1/1 en el campo de batalla.\\n{1}{R}, sacrificar un Trasgo: el Comandante de sitiadores hace 2 puntos de daño a la criatura o jugador objetivo.', 'type': 'Criatura — Trasgo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200708&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bec54e65-ff44-415e-9ecd-fa13433d8901', 'multiverseId': 200708}, 'multiverseid': 200708}, {'name': 'Commandant des assiégeants', 'text': 'Quand le Commandant des assiégeants arrive sur le champ de bataille, mettez trois jetons de créature 1/1 rouge Gobelin sur le champ de bataille.\\n{1}{R}, sacrifiez un gobelin : Le Commandant des assiégeants inflige 2 blessures à une cible, créature ou joueur.', 'type': 'Créature : gobelin', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199463&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2c186e03-28b3-4196-a885-d02572a297e4', 'multiverseId': 199463}, 'multiverseid': 199463}, {'name': 'Capo della Squadra di Assedio', 'text': 'Quando il Capo della Squadra di Assedio entra nel campo di battaglia, metti sul campo di battaglia tre pedine creatura Goblin 1/1 rosse.\\n{1}{R}, Sacrifica un Goblin: Il Capo della Squadra di Assedio infligge 2 danni a una creatura o a un giocatore bersaglio.', 'type': 'Creatura — Goblin', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200459&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f1c9eebb-9747-4f06-b9e0-440526d4dc14', 'multiverseId': 200459}, 'multiverseid': 200459}, {'name': '包囲攻撃の司令官', 'text': '包囲攻撃の司令官が戦場に出たとき、赤の１/１のゴブリン･クリーチャー・トークンを３体戦場に出す。\\n{1}{R}, ゴブリンを１体生け贄に捧げる：クリーチャー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。包囲攻撃の司令官はそれに２点のダメージを与える。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ゴブリン', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199961&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cff8e6b6-d9c1-485e-93d3-c00dd90a3f71', 'multiverseId': 199961}, 'multiverseid': 199961}, {'name': 'Comandante do Grupo de Cerco', 'text': 'Quando Comandante do Grupo de Cerco entra no campo de batalha, coloque no campo de batalha três fichas de criaturas vermelhas 1/1 do tipo Goblin.\\n{1}{R}, Sacrifique um Goblin: Comandante do Grupo de Cerco causa 2 pontos de dano à criatura ou ao jogador alvo.', 'type': 'Criatura — Goblin', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199214&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c1f46074-fcbe-49bd-be3b-9b80e7a20342', 'multiverseId': 199214}, 'multiverseid': 199214}, {'name': 'Командир Осадчиков', 'text': 'Когда Командир Осадчиков выходит на поле битвы, положите на поле битвы три фишки существа 1/1 красный Гоблин.\\n{1}{R}, пожертвуйте Гоблина: Командир Осадчиков наносит 2 повреждения целевому существу или игроку.', 'type': 'Существо — Гоблин', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200210&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5162ebf3-b66d-4163-ad83-ca883c420c6a', 'multiverseId': 200210}, 'multiverseid': 200210}, {'name': '攻城指挥官', 'text': '当攻城指挥官进战场时，将三个1/1红色鬼怪衍生物放进战场。\\n{1}{R}，牺牲一个鬼怪：攻城指挥官对目标生物或牌手造成2点伤害。', 'type': '生物～鬼怪', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200957&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '47430a98-6978-47ed-98fa-f0e88c2b391e', 'multiverseId': 200957}, 'multiverseid': 200957}]", '[{\'name\': \'Bergschlucht-Minotaurus\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Minotaurus, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'„Wir schleichen uns über diese Klippen, überqueren die wackelige Brücke, und suchen uns dann einen Weg durch die Vulkanhänge auf der anderen Seite." „Ich dachte, der kürzeste Weg wäre durch die Schlucht?" „Das stimmt." „Sollten wir dann nicht...?" „Nein."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199685&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4cbb54d-9fe5-49ed-b4aa-9a9e4bdd3814\', \'multiverseId\': 199685}, \'multiverseid\': 199685}, {\'name\': \'Minotauro del desfiladero\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero minotauro\', \'flavor\': \'"Escalaremos estas cornisas, atravesaremos el Puente Frágil, y luego bajaremos por las pendientes volcánicas del otro lado." "¿Pero la ruta más corta no es por el desfiladero?" "Sí." "¿Entonces no deberíamos...?" "No."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200681&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c9e74c4-702a-41c0-8654-cfbd966b37cf\', \'multiverseId\': 200681}, \'multiverseid\': 200681}, {\'name\': \'Minotaure des canyons\', \'type\': \'Créature : minotaure et guerrier\', \'flavor\': "« Nous escaladerons ces falaises, nous traverserons Frêlepont et nous nous fraierons un chemin sur les pentes volcaniques avec nos armes. » « Ce n\'est pas plus court en passant par le canyon ? » « Si, en effet. » « Ne devrait-on alors pas — » « Non. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199436&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad3d72fa-068c-4710-9bca-4c8ed8ea9859\', \'multiverseId\': 199436}, \'multiverseid\': 199436}, {\'name\': \'Minotauro del Canyon\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Minotauro\', \'flavor\': \'"Scaliamo questi dirupi, attraversiamo Ponte Friabile e poi ci facciamo strada scendendo lungo le scarpate vulcaniche sull\\\'altro lato." "Non è più corto attraversare il canyon?" "Sì." "Quindi non dovremmo..." "No."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200432&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dfbacc62-f5d9-420e-853a-e4e312ed20e3\', \'multiverseId\': 200432}, \'multiverseid\': 200432}, {\'name\': \'峡谷のミノタウルス\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ミノタウルス・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'「ここの崖を登り、崩れ橋を渡って、逆側の火口坂を戦いながら下がっていくことになります。」 「これは峡谷の一番の近道じゃなかったのか？」 「間違いないです。」 「それならそんな――」 「駄目です。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199934&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bdd5c7a5-5309-4600-bca0-4c4821b5176e\', \'multiverseId\': 199934}, \'multiverseid\': 199934}, {\'name\': \'Minotauro do Desfiladeiro\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Minotauro Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Vamos escalar esses penhascos, atravessar a Ponte Quebradiça e abrir caminho na marra através da encosta vulcânica do outro lado." "A rota mais curta não seria através do desfiladeiro?" "Sim." "Então não devíamos..." "Não."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199187&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'048ef794-c351-4888-a810-79169e13be6c\', \'multiverseId\': 199187}, \'multiverseid\': 199187}, {\'name\': \'Каньонный Минотавр\', \'type\': \'Существо — Минотавр Воин\', \'flavor\': \'«Мы взберемся на вот эти утесы, перейдем Шаткий Мост, а потом проложим себе путь вниз, по склонам вулкана на другой стороне». «Но ведь самый короткий путь лежит через каньон?» «Да». «Так, может, нам надо...» «Не надо».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200183&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72d4af21-4ee7-46a2-b580-3022f6d0c897\', \'multiverseId\': 200183}, \'multiverseid\': 200183}, {\'name\': \'峡谷牛头怪\', \'type\': \'生物～牛头怪／战士\', \'flavor\': \'「我们要爬上这些悬崖，横越危桥，然后从另一侧的火山坡一路打下去。」 「这不正是横越峡谷的最短路径？」 「对。」 「那么我们难道～」 「不能。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200930&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ac06078-17e5-41c1-a0b2-9ee61b035e56\', \'multiverseId\': 200930}, \'multiverseid\': 200930}]', '[{\'name\': \'Berserker aus der Blutklamm\', \'text\': \'Der Berserker aus der Blutklamm greift in jedem Zug an, falls möglich.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Berserker\', \'flavor\': \'Sie leisten einen Bluteid, in der Schlacht zu sterben. Bislang hat noch keiner dieses Versprechen gebrochen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199681&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a199c0f9-6520-49fd-aed0-45552c9e592f\', \'multiverseId\': 199681}, \'multiverseid\': 199681}, {\'name\': \'Berserkers del Risco Sangriento\', \'text\': \'Los Berserkers del Risco Sangriento atacan cada turno si pueden.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Berserker humano\', \'flavor\': \'Hicieron un juramento con sangre de morir en la batalla. Hasta ahora ninguno faltó a su promesa.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200677&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'600fec28-68c6-4218-b360-cb82216e48cd\', \'multiverseId\': 200677}, \'multiverseid\': 200677}, {\'name\': \'Berserkers des Contreforts de Sang\', \'text\': \'Les Berserkers des Contreforts de Sang attaquent à chaque tour si possible.\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et berserker\', \'flavor\': "Ils font le serment de mourir au combat. Jusque-là, aucun d\'eux n\'a failli à sa promesse.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199432&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ebab3a3-219e-4220-a5d8-87b2a682c05e\', \'multiverseId\': 199432}, \'multiverseid\': 199432}, {\'name\': \'Berserker di Crinale Sanguinario\', \'text\': \'I Berserker di Crinale Sanguinario attaccano ogni turno, se possono farlo.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Berserker Umano\', \'flavor\': \'Hanno fatto un giuramento di sangue di morire in battaglia. Finora nessuno ha mancato di mantenere la promessa.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200428&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54ea89a4-8ccd-4581-b686-05fbad6462a4\', \'multiverseId\': 200428}, \'multiverseid\': 200428}, {\'name\': \'血の峠の狂戦士\', \'text\': \'血の峠の狂戦士は、可能なら毎ターン攻撃する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・狂戦士\', \'flavor\': \'彼らは戦場で死す血の誓いを立てている。 これまで、その誓いを守れなかった者はいない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199930&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d88dbde-001d-4153-b6c3-3dcb070e23d7\', \'multiverseId\': 199930}, \'multiverseid\': 199930}, {\'name\': \'Amoques das Montanhas Sanguíneas\', \'text\': \'Amoques das Montanhas Sanguíneas ataca em todos os turnos se estiver apto.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Amoque\', \'flavor\': \'Eles fazem o juramento de morrer em combate. Até agora todos cumpriram essa promessa.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199183&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e3477b1e-98e4-4b29-8b1f-7f3a2717aedb\', \'multiverseId\': 199183}, \'multiverseid\': 199183}, {\'name\': \'Берсерки Кровавого Хребта\', \'text\': \'Берсерки Кровавого Хребта атакуют в каждом ходу, если могут.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Берсерк\', \'flavor\': \'Они дают клятву кровью умереть в сражении. Пока что ни один из них ее не нарушил.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200179&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2055e7f8-a78b-4f43-b35b-2b8aee5eef92\', \'multiverseId\': 200179}, \'multiverseid\': 200179}, {\'name\': \'血山脊狂战士\', \'text\': \'血山脊狂战士每回合若能攻击，则必须攻击。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／狂战士\', \'flavor\': \'他们立下血誓，死就该死在战场上。 目前没人违背过诺言。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200926&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15b6910d-0461-4336-9ff1-a2e014ffc8eb\', \'multiverseId\': 200926}, \'multiverseid\': 200926}]', '[{\'name\': \'Betörende Sirene\', \'text\': \'{T}: Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die ein Gegner kontrolliert, greift dich in diesem Zug an, falls möglich.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Sirene\', \'flavor\': \'„Denn es bezaubert ihn der helle Gesang der Sirenen, Die auf der Wiese sitzen, von aufgehäuftem Gebeine Modernder Menschen umringt und ausgetrockneten Häuten. Aber du steure vorbei, und verkleibe die Ohren der Freunde Mit dem geschmolzenen Wachse der Honigscheiben!" —Homer, Die Odyssee,\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199598&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46b0cd9d-470a-4bca-9eec-5f3ebaf47839\', \'multiverseId\': 199598}, \'multiverseid\': 199598}, {\'name\': \'Sirena tentadora\', \'text\': \'{T}: La criatura objetivo que controla un oponente te ataca este turno si puede.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Sirena\', \'flavor\': \'"El prado lleno de huesos putrefactos, restos humanos esparcidos por la costa. Haz pasar de largo a la nave; ¡que todos los oídos estén untados con cera! ¡Escucharlas es morir!" —Homero, La Odisea\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200594&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f770f479-e355-4ab9-a8f2-e4a0dc831dcd\', \'multiverseId\': 200594}, \'multiverseid\': 200594}, {\'name\': \'Sirène attirante\', \'text\': "{T} : La créature ciblée qu\'un adversaire contrôle vous attaque ce tour-ci si possible.", \'type\': \'Créature : sirène\', \'flavor\': "« De leurs fraîches voix, les sirènes le charment, et le pré, leur séjour, est bordé d\'un rivage tout blanchi d\'ossements et de débris humains, dont les chairs se corrompent. Passe sans t\'arrêter ! » —Homère, L\'Odyssée", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199349&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'214af98a-2a4b-4dea-87e8-db0ace40993c\', \'multiverseId\': 199349}, \'multiverseid\': 199349}, {\'name\': \'Sirena Seducente\', \'text\': \'{T}: Una creatura bersaglio controllata da un avversario ti attacca in questo turno, se può farlo.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Sirena\', \'flavor\': \'"Infetto è il terreno e ricoperto di sangue umano, Spaventosa è la riva macchiata da macello umano Fuggi dalla costa perigliosa per non sentire! L\\\'orecchio tappato poiché udir quel canto è morire!" —Omero, Odissea\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200345&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f946ea54-016c-4315-9a05-31accaf37264\', \'multiverseId\': 200345}, \'multiverseid\': 200345}, {\'name\': \'魅惑するセイレーン\', \'text\': \'{T}：いずれかの対戦相手がコントロールするクリーチャー１体を対象とする。このターン、それは可能ならあなたを攻撃する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — セイレーン\', \'flavor\': \'「その大地を穢す諸人の流せる血よ、 屠られし者共の恐るべき岸に満つるを見よ。 危難満つる岸辺を速やかに離れよ。あらゆる耳に告ぐ、 その歌に傾くことなかれ！ 聞かば死の来たるは直ぐ！」 ――ホメロス「オデュッセイア」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199847&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24460927-4442-4188-b714-d4cb18ef93da\', \'multiverseId\': 199847}, \'multiverseid\': 199847}, {\'name\': \'Sirena Sedutora\', \'text\': \'{T}: A criatura alvo controlada por um oponente o ataca neste turno se estiver apta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Sirena\', \'flavor\': \'"A campina poluída de restos humanos, A costa empestada com a carnificina Fuja desse perigoso porto: que todo ouvido Esteja surdo a essa canção! Pois é morte certa!" —Homero, A Odisseia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199100&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a1f9106-aef4-49a9-91e3-5f44e51bc3a1\', \'multiverseId\': 199100}, \'multiverseid\': 199100}, {\'name\': \'Пленительная Сирена\', \'text\': \'{T}: целевое существо под контролем оппонента атакует вас в этом ходу, если может.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Сирена\', \'flavor\': \'«Ручьи кровавые по той земле бегут, И кости человечьи в ней гниют. Спеши проклятый берег миновать, Не внемли песне, коль не хочешь умирать!» — Гомер, Одиссея\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200096&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa9e8de7-23fa-422a-840c-58fe8ecf952d\', \'multiverseId\': 200096}, \'multiverseid\': 200096}, {\'name\': \'诱人塞连\', \'text\': \'{T}：目标由对手操控的生物本回合若能攻击你，则必须攻击。\', \'type\': \'生物～塞连\', \'flavor\': \'「地上遍布人类血块， 这场杀戮将沙滩化为恶境。 就让这歌声传遍危险的海岸， 透入每只耳朵！ 此乃死亡之声！」 ～荷马，《奥德赛》\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200843&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1eb0f278-f4ff-4a6c-b59e-620617c368f6\', \'multiverseId\': 200843}, \'multiverseid\': 200843}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blendender Magier\', \'text\': \'{W}, {T}: Tappe eine Kreatur deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich trage das Licht der Wahrheit mit mir. Wer davon geblendet wird, konnte ohnehin nie wirklich sehen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199560&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'814522e0-1b95-427e-a8fa-99d9589e29fa\', \'multiverseId\': 199560}, \'multiverseid\': 199560}, {\'name\': \'Mago cegador\', \'text\': \'{W}, {T}: Gira la criatura objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Llevo la luz de la verdad. No tengas lástima de aquellos a quienes ciega, porque nunca tuvieron ojos para ver."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200556&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02d9b2a5-c4d9-42d2-8078-8ab3d1e874d5\', \'multiverseId\': 200556}, \'multiverseid\': 200556}, {\'name\': \'Mage aveuglant\', \'text\': \'{W}, {T} : Engagez la créature ciblée.\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': "« Je détiens la lumière de la vérité. Ne plaignez pas ceux qu\'elle aveugle, car leurs yeux ne leur servait pas pour voir. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199311&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c21af5ef-f372-488b-8b6d-52d539c9740f\', \'multiverseId\': 199311}, \'multiverseid\': 199311}, {\'name\': \'Mago Accecante\', \'text\': \'{W}, {T}: TAPpa una creatura bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Porto la luce della verità. Non compatite quelli che acceca, poiché non hanno mai avuto occhi per vederla."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200307&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1542ffa0-4b7d-4e2c-a9fe-39538dad92ac\', \'multiverseId\': 200307}, \'multiverseid\': 200307}, {\'name\': \'目潰しの魔道士\', \'text\': \'{W}, {T}：クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それをタップする。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'「私がもたらすのは真実の光だ。 それに盲いらされた者を哀れんではいけない。彼らには元々見る目など無かったのだ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199809&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a339cb39-bc63-48c6-bdaa-bd6ceb0d71ef\', \'multiverseId\': 199809}, \'multiverseid\': 199809}, {\'name\': \'Mago Cegador\', \'text\': \'{W}, {T}: Vire a criatura alvo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Mago\', \'flavor\': \'"Eu trago a luz da verdade. Não tenha piedade daqueles a quem ela cega, pois eles nunca tiveram olhos para ver."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199062&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39c49ae5-93c8-47b9-b0a8-4d0e87e71c62\', \'multiverseId\': 199062}, \'multiverseid\': 199062}, {\'name\': \'Ослепляющий Маг\', \'text\': \'{W}, {T}: поверните целевое существо.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Чародей\', \'flavor\': \'«Я несу свет правды. Не жалей тех, кого он ослепляет, ибо у них никогда не было глаз, чтобы узреть».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200058&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c87b913-cb1e-4bc5-be16-36fa4e32544c\', \'multiverseId\': 200058}, \'multiverseid\': 200058}, {\'name\': \'眩目法师\', \'text\': \'{W}，{T}：横置目标生物。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'「真理光芒与我同行。 毋须同情因其盲目者，因为他们的眼睛本就看不到。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200805&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b3de889-9c4c-417c-8d1d-b8a48113b060\', \'multiverseId\': 200805}, \'multiverseid\': 200805}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blitzeis\', \'text\': \'Neutralisiere einen roten oder grünen Zauberspruch deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Dein Fehler war nicht deine Ignoranz, deine Schwäche oder deine Überheblichkeit, sondern dein warmes Blut." —Heidar, Meister des Raureifs\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199608&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41cbf8b9-2865-42a1-bb76-b78cb7d1fae6\', \'multiverseId\': 199608}, \'multiverseid\': 199608}, {\'name\': \'Congelación repentina\', \'text\': \'Contrarresta el hechizo objetivo rojo o verde.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Tu perdición no fue tu ignorancia, tu debilidad o tu arrogancia, sino tu sangre caliente." —Heidar, maestro brisa escarchada\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200604&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed8a3fa3-fe08-4768-8c86-e268fdd3de89\', \'multiverseId\': 200604}, \'multiverseid\': 200604}, {\'name\': \'Gel immédiat\', \'text\': \'Contrecarrez le sort rouge ou vert ciblé.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« L\'instrument de votre chute ne fut pas votre ignorance, votre faiblesse ou même votre orgueil mais la simple chaleur de votre sang. » —Heidar, maître de Soufflegivre", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199359&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b60366f-7698-4618-88b1-dbed1ea2ce3d\', \'multiverseId\': 199359}, \'multiverseid\': 199359}, {\'name\': \'Gelolampo\', \'text\': \'Neutralizza una magia rossa o verde bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"La tua rovina non è stata l\\\'ignoranza, la debolezza o la tracotanza, ma il tuo sangue caldo." —Heidar, maestro di Ventogelo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200355&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'161548e1-5f0e-4a4a-9200-8e22ec0a2580\', \'multiverseId\': 200355}, \'multiverseid\': 200355}, {\'name\': \'瞬間凍結\', \'text\': \'赤か緑の呪文１つを対象とし、それを打ち消す。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「お前の失敗は、無知のせいでも、弱さのせいでも、不遜のせいでもない。お前の血が温かかったせいだ。」 ――霧氷風の使い手、ハイダー\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199857&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'092ce074-4a05-4dfd-9665-73bfb3fa3b2f\', \'multiverseId\': 199857}, \'multiverseid\': 199857}, {\'name\': \'Congelar Rápido\', \'text\': \'Anule a mágica alvo vermelha ou verde.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"O seu ponto fraco não era a sua ignorância, suas falhas ou sua arrogância, e sim o seu sangue quente." — Heidar, mestre Vento-Gélido\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199110&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b8af851-aba1-4af1-8604-0ccc7e6a1f5b\', \'multiverseId\': 199110}, \'multiverseid\': 199110}, {\'name\': \'Мгновенная Заморозка\', \'text\': \'Отмените целевое красное или зеленое заклинание.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Тебя погубило не невежество, не слабость и не гордыня, а твоя теплая кровь». — Хейдар, Ледоветренный мастер\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200106&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d26f015-c59b-4230-88e5-beb9926a46f9\', \'multiverseId\': 200106}, \'multiverseid\': 200106}, {\'name\': \'快速冻结\', \'text\': \'反击目标红色或绿色咒语。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「你败亡之因不是由于你的无知、贫弱或傲慢，而是你的温热血液。」 ～霜风会首领亥达\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200853&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'580bdeba-261c-4cf4-a51b-c6b259b35b05\', \'multiverseId\': 200853}, \'multiverseid\': 200853}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blitzelementar\', \'text\': \'Eile (Diese Kreatur kann angreifen und {T}, sobald sie unter deine Kontrolle kommt.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elementarwesen\', \'flavor\': \'„Ein Blitz im Gewitter kommt leuchtend herab, Er scheidet vom Leben und ruht jetzt im Grab." —William Knox, „Sterblichkeit"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199702&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24fd731c-1a43-4cce-a80c-dcdaeae81582\', \'multiverseId\': 199702}, \'multiverseid\': 199702}, {\'name\': \'Elemental de rayos\', \'text\': \'Prisa. (Esta criatura puede atacar y {T} tan pronto como entre bajo tu control.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': \'"Un destello del relámpago, un rompimiento de la ola, Él pasa de la vida a descansar en la tumba." William Knox, "Mortalidad"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200698&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a165228-65b5-48bf-ad10-6d0c26474023\', \'multiverseId\': 200698}, \'multiverseid\': 200698}, {\'name\': "Élémental d\'éclair", \'text\': \'Célérité (Cette créature peut attaquer et {T} dès le tour où elle arrive sous votre contrôle.)\', \'type\': \'Créature : élémental\', \'flavor\': "« Je vais, d\'un coup de poing, te briser comme verre (…)Ou te jeter si haut au-dessus des éclairs, Que tu sois dévoré des feux élémentaires. » —Corneille, L\'Illusion comique", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199453&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a8658c9b-fb96-464f-a9b9-51dd3f2c94b0\', \'multiverseId\': 199453}, \'multiverseid\': 199453}, {\'name\': \'Elementale dei Fulmini\', \'text\': \'Rapidità (Questa creatura può attaccare e {T} non appena entra sotto il tuo controllo.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Elementale\', \'flavor\': \'"Un varco nell\\\'onda, un lampo improvviso, Dalla vita alla morte con un sorriso." —William Knox, "Mortalità"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200449&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ae57ba2d-3db4-4a0c-b664-ab728f92f37a\', \'multiverseId\': 200449}, \'multiverseid\': 200449}, {\'name\': \'稲妻の精霊\', \'text\': \'速攻 （このクリーチャーは、あなたのコントロール下になってすぐに攻撃したり{T}したりできる。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エレメンタル\', \'flavor\': \'「稲妻のきらめき、波のひと砕き、 彼は生から墓所の休息へと移っていった。」 ――ウィリアム・ノックス「死すべきもの」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199951&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce4983ae-46e5-4fda-b329-0e97235257ff\', \'multiverseId\': 199951}, \'multiverseid\': 199951}, {\'name\': \'Elemental do Relâmpago\', \'text\': \'Ímpeto (Esta criatura pode atacar e {T} assim que entra sob seu controle.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': \'"Um clarão de relâmpago, o quebrar de uma onda, Da vida ele passa, ao repouso na cova funda." — William Knox, "Mortalidade"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199204&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65db622f-3b9e-49ae-890d-5f34bac3c127\', \'multiverseId\': 199204}, \'multiverseid\': 199204}, {\'name\': \'Элементаль Молний\', \'text\': \'Ускорение (Это существо может атаковать и {T}, как только оно попадает под ваш контроль.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Элементаль\', \'flavor\': \'«Блеск молнии, бушующий прибой, И он навеки обретет покой». — Уильям Нокс, «Смертный»\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200200&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c25eb516-55d5-4fee-ab91-91daeff1f0f2\', \'multiverseId\': 200200}, \'multiverseid\': 200200}, {\'name\': \'闪电元素\', \'text\': \'敏捷 （此生物受你操控时便能攻击与{T}。）\', \'type\': \'生物～元素\', \'flavor\': \'「闪耀的光芒，波动的裂隙， 他穿过生命直达墓场而安息。」 ～威廉•诺克斯，「凡命」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200947&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'059c1736-2d97-40ad-8620-2cc3741241a6\', \'multiverseId\': 200947}, \'multiverseid\': 200947}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blitzschlag\', \'text\': \'Der Blitzschlag fügt einer Kreatur oder einem Spieler deiner Wahl 3 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Der Funkenmagier kreischte auf und beschwor die Wildheit der Stürme seiner Jugend. Zu seiner Überraschung antwortete der Himmel mit einer wilden Energie, mit der er nicht mehr gerechnet hatte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199701&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b8a1bda-49c8-4737-ab1b-892cb8217518\', \'multiverseId\': 199701}, \'multiverseid\': 199701}, {\'name\': \'Relámpago\', \'text\': \'El Relámpago hace 3 puntos de daño a la criatura o jugador objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'El magochispa gritó, invocando la ira de las tormentas de su juventud. Para su sorpresa, el cielo respondió con una energía que nunca pensó que volvería a ver.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200697&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ba97b51-148e-47ab-8a99-e19764c89b59\', \'multiverseId\': 200697}, \'multiverseid\': 200697}, {\'name\': \'Foudre\', \'text\': \'La Foudre inflige 3 blessures à une cible, créature ou joueur.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "L\'étincemage hurla, appelant la rage des tempêtes de sa jeunesse. À sa grande surprise, le ciel lui répondit avec une énergie redoutable qu\'il avait pensé ne jamais revoir.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199452&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35d1bbd2-39ff-4578-bee3-9ddf4e357d0b\', \'multiverseId\': 199452}, \'multiverseid\': 199452}, {\'name\': \'Fulmine\', \'text\': \'Il Fulmine infligge 3 danni a una creatura o a un giocatore bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': "Il magoscintilla urlò, facendo appello all\'ira delle tempeste della sua giovinezza. Con sua gran sorpresa, il cielo rispose con un\'intensa energia che non pensava di rivedere mai più.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200448&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'906e1087-e6e3-452b-a73f-b3bc1506d67b\', \'multiverseId\': 200448}, \'multiverseid\': 200448}, {\'name\': \'稲妻\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。稲妻はそれに３点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'火花魔道士は叫び、彼が若かった頃の嵐の怒りを呼び起こそうとした。 驚いたことに、空はもう再び見られないと思った恐るべき力で応えた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199950&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b68be6a7-0515-42e0-abe9-b3f14b118c19\', \'multiverseId\': 199950}, \'multiverseid\': 199950}, {\'name\': \'Raio\', \'text\': \'Raio causa 3 pontos de dano à criatura ou ao jogador alvo.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'O mago de centelhas urrou, invocando a ira das tempestades de sua juventude. Para sua surpresa, o céu respondeu com uma energia feroz que ele acreditava que nunca mais veria.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199203&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'264ed46f-a201-468b-93e3-62993fab5bc4\', \'multiverseId\': 199203}, \'multiverseid\': 199203}, {\'name\': \'Удар Молнии\', \'text\': \'Удар Молнии наносит 3 повреждения целевому существу или игроку.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Электромаг пронзительно закричал, взывая к ярости бурь своей молодости. К его изумлению, небо ответило неистовым сгустком энергии, который он не ожидал увидеть снова.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200199&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b19ce056-c034-493a-966b-97a2f90ef728\', \'multiverseId\': 200199}, \'multiverseid\': 200199}, {\'name\': \'闪电击\', \'text\': \'闪电击对目标生物或牌手造成3点伤害。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'火花法师大叫着，呼唤他年轻时的风暴之怒。 令他意外的是：天空用他从未奢望复见的强大能量来回应。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200946&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3bc303f7-55ee-4870-987d-ec424c67ef1a\', \'multiverseId\': 200946}, \'multiverseid\': 200946}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blutroter Bund\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du Lebenspunkte dazuerhältst, verliert ein Gegner deiner Wahl so viele Lebenspunkte.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Blut ist ein Kreislauf. Jeden Tropfen, den ich trinke, muss ein anderer bluten." —Vradeen, Vampir der Nacht\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199666&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d510349e-c2c4-45b9-b903-748bf916b900\', \'multiverseId\': 199666}, \'multiverseid\': 199666}, {\'name\': \'Vínculo sangriento\', \'text\': \'Siempre que ganes vidas, el oponente objetivo pierde esa misma cantidad de vidas.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"La sangre es constante. Por cada gota que bebo, alguien debe sangrar." —Vradeen, nócturnus vampiro\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200662&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26933c00-788e-4586-ab50-97b50bb9810a\', \'multiverseId\': 200662}, \'multiverseid\': 200662}, {\'name\': \'Lien sanguin\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous gagnez des points de vie, l\'adversaire ciblé perd autant de points de vie.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "« Le sang est une constante. Pour chaque goutte que je bois, quelqu\'un saigne. » —Vradeen, nocturnus vampire", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199417&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7d9eda6-5984-4528-b1c0-ea9ae1a0bab9\', \'multiverseId\': 199417}, \'multiverseid\': 199417}, {\'name\': \'Legame Sanguigno\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta guadagni punti vita, un avversario bersaglio perde altrettanti punti vita.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Il sangue è costante. Per ogni goccia che bevo, qualcuno deve sanguinare." —Vradeen, vampiro notturno\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200413&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11ac4f29-4ae8-453f-81b5-d66a731ea056\', \'multiverseId\': 200413}, \'multiverseid\': 200413}, {\'name\': \'血なまぐさい結合\', \'text\': \'あなたがライフを得るたび、対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーはその点数に等しい点数のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「血は一定だ。 我が一滴飲むためには、誰かが流さねばならぬ。」 ――吸血鬼の夜侯、ヴラディーン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199915&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fbee0843-d577-4ccc-8abf-07bb7e36e832\', \'multiverseId\': 199915}, \'multiverseid\': 199915}, {\'name\': \'Pacto de Sangue\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você ganha pontos de vida, o oponente alvo perde uma quantidade igual de pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"O sangue flui com constância. Cada gota que bebo foi derramada por alguém." —Vradeen, vampiro noturno\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199168&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5cf401bd-6a09-42a5-a3c6-a3f3735c8127\', \'multiverseId\': 199168}, \'multiverseid\': 199168}, {\'name\': \'Кровавые Узы\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда вы получаете какое-либо количество жизней, целевой оппонент теряет столько же жизней.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': \'«Кровь не может возникнуть из ничего. Кто-то должен сначала пролить каждую каплю, которую я выпью». — Врадин, вампир-ноктурнус\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200164&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e64a75b4-39c8-49e3-a8a6-f22b96c396f4\', \'multiverseId\': 200164}, \'multiverseid\': 200164}, {\'name\': \'血色羁绊\', \'text\': \'每当你获得生命时，目标对手失去等量的生命。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「血量是个定数。 我喝的每滴血都流自别人身上。」 ～暗夜吸血鬼法迪\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200911&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43bd1157-08cb-4868-9465-fc1a934bb986\', \'multiverseId\': 200911}, \'multiverseid\': 200911}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bogardanischer Höllendrache\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen (Du kannst diesen Zauberspruch zu jedem Zeitpunkt wirken, zu dem du einen Spontanzauber wirken könntest.)\\nFliegend\\nWenn der Bogardanische Höllendrache ins Spiel kommt, fügt er 5 Schadenspunkte zu, deren Aufteilung auf eine beliebige Anzahl an Kreaturen und/oder Spielern deiner Wahl du bestimmst.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Drache\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199682&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f712b1b-a10b-449c-854e-dbc490d0866b\', \'multiverseId\': 199682}, \'multiverseid\': 199682}, {\'name\': \'Engendro de Bogardan\', \'text\': \'Destello. (Puedes lanzar este hechizo en cualquier momento en que pudieras lanzar un instantáneo.)\\nVuela.\\nCuando el Engendro de Bogardan entre en el campo de batalla, hace 5 puntos de daño divididos como elijas entre cualquier número de criaturas y/o jugadores objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragón\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200678&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'173aec3e-3f32-4d88-9c02-cc87f327f92c\', \'multiverseId\': 200678}, \'multiverseid\': 200678}, {\'name\': \'Escouflenfer du Bogardân\', \'text\': "Flash (Vous pouvez lancer ce sort à tout moment où vous pourriez lancer un éphémère.)\\nVol\\nQuand l\'Escouflenfer du Bogardân arrive sur le champ de bataille, il inflige 5 blessures réparties comme vous le voulez entre n\'importe quel nombre de cibles, créatures et/ou joueurs.", \'type\': \'Créature : dragon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199433&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5949c170-7e50-43ee-a8be-f25f9e6b2a35\', \'multiverseId\': 199433}, \'multiverseid\': 199433}, {\'name\': \'Nibbio Infernale di Bogardan\', \'text\': \'Lampo (Puoi lanciare questa magia in ogni momento in cui potresti lanciare un istantaneo.)\\nVolare\\nQuando il Nibbio Infernale di Bogardan entra nel campo di battaglia, infligge 5 danni suddivisi a tua scelta tra un qualsiasi numero di creature e/o giocatori bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Drago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200429&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e21cc697-2eaa-4dd3-931b-ac6adeb78c7d\', \'multiverseId\': 200429}, \'multiverseid\': 200429}, {\'name\': \'ボガーダンのヘルカイト\', \'text\': \'瞬速 （あなたはこの呪文を、あなたがインスタントを唱えられるときならいつでも唱えてよい。）\\n飛行\\nボガーダンのヘルカイトが戦場に出たとき、望む数のクリーチャーかプレイヤー（またはその組み合わせ）を対象とする。ボガーダンのヘルカイトは、それらに５点のダメージを好きなように割り振って与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドラゴン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199931&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9cdeb0c5-3f62-411d-b95b-d77a4dac9f25\', \'multiverseId\': 199931}, \'multiverseid\': 199931}, {\'name\': \'Dragão Avérneo de Bogardan\', \'text\': \'Lampejo (Você poderá conjurar esta mágica a qualquer momento em que puder conjurar uma mágica instantânea.)\\nVoar\\nQuando Dragão Avérneo de Bogardan entra no campo de batalha, ele causa 5 pontos de dano distribuídos à sua escolha entre qualquer número de criaturas e/ou jogadores alvo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragão\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199184&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59a7523a-55ba-413b-bab7-309d0e0cf733\', \'multiverseId\': 199184}, \'multiverseid\': 199184}, {\'name\': \'Богарданский Змей\', \'text\': \'Миг (Вы можете разыграть это заклинание при любой возможности разыгрывать мгновенные заклинания.)\\nПолет\\nКогда Богарданский Змей выходит на поле битвы, он наносит 5 повреждений, разделенных по вашему выбору между любым количеством целевых существ и (или) игроков.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Дракон\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200180&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c081225-f48b-40b6-a447-3dd6273809ed\', \'multiverseId\': 200180}, \'multiverseid\': 200180}, {\'name\': \'博卡登残虐者\', \'text\': \'闪现 （你可以于你能够施放瞬间的时机下施放此咒语。）\\n飞行\\n当博卡登残虐者进战场时，它对任意数量的目标生物和／或牌手造成共5点伤害，你可以任意分配。\', \'type\': \'生物～龙\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200927&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e79c65c3-3f01-4cab-99c7-4b4c8e5684dd\', \'multiverseId\': 200927}, \'multiverseid\': 200927}]', '[{\'name\': \'Botschafter-Sphinx\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn die Botschafter-Sphinx einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, durchsuche die Bibliothek dieses Spielers nach einer Karte, anschließend nennt dieser Spieler eine Karte. Falls du nach einer Kreaturenkarte gesucht hast, deren Name nicht mit dem genannten übereinstimmt, kannst du sie unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel bringen. Dieser Spieler mischt dann seine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Sphinx\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199628&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f420764-7bf8-439b-951a-2e3a82945640\', \'multiverseId\': 199628}, \'multiverseid\': 199628}, {\'name\': \'Esfinge embajadora\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que la Esfinge embajadora haga daño de combate a un jugador, busca una carta en la biblioteca de ese jugador, luego ese jugador nombra una carta. Si buscaste una carta de criatura que no es la carta nombrada, puedes ponerla en el campo de batalla bajo tu control. Luego ese jugador baraja su biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Esfinge\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200624&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93de2039-0b8c-4c30-a5c5-1bd2d6872f42\', \'multiverseId\': 200624}, \'multiverseid\': 200624}, {\'name\': \'Ambassadeur sphinx\', \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois que l\'Ambassadeur sphinx inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, cherchez une carte dans la bibliothèque de ce joueur, et ce joueur nomme ensuite une carte. Si vous avez cherché une carte de créature qui n\'est pas la carte nommée, vous pouvez la mettre sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle. Ce joueur mélange ensuite sa bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Créature : sphinx\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199379&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c844389-b9cf-40ce-aab7-b8a9ab456e6d\', \'multiverseId\': 199379}, \'multiverseid\': 199379}, {\'name\': \'Sfinge Ambasciatrice\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nOgniqualvolta la Sfinge Ambasciatrice infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, passa in rassegna il grimorio di quel giocatore per una carta, poi quel giocatore nomina una carta. Se hai passato in rassegna per una carta creatura che non è la carta nominata, puoi metterla sul campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo. Poi quel giocatore rimescola il suo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Sfinge\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200375&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8213733c-0413-44b4-9925-5ca09547b5ea\', \'multiverseId\': 200375}, \'multiverseid\': 200375}, {\'name\': \'スフィンクスの大使\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nスフィンクスの大使がいずれかのプレイヤーに戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、そのプレイヤーのライブラリーからカードを１枚探し、その後そのプレイヤーはカード名を１つ指定する。 あなたが指定されたカード名でないクリーチャー・カードを探していた場合、あなたはそれを、あなたのコントロール下で戦場に出してもよい。 その後、そのプレイヤーは自分のライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スフィンクス\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199877&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'022145fe-bf12-4b6a-ae4b-bac7e3ad3c30\', \'multiverseId\': 199877}, \'multiverseid\': 199877}, {\'name\': \'Esfinge Embaixadora\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nToda vez que Esfinge Embaixadora causar dano de combate a um jogador, procure por um card no grimório desse jogador. Depois, aquele jogador nomeia um card. Se você procurou por um card de criatura diferente do card nomeado, pode colocá-lo no campo de batalha sob seu controle. Depois, aquele jogador embaralha seu próprio grimório.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Esfinge\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199130&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'522884d8-f63a-42b9-91a4-21c8fad5e136\', \'multiverseId\': 199130}, \'multiverseid\': 199130}, {\'name\': \'Сфинкс-Посланник\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКаждый раз, когда Сфинкс-Посланник наносит боевые повреждения игроку, найдите в библиотеке того игрока карту, затем тот игрок называет карту. Если вы нашли карту существа, которая не является названной картой, вы можете положить ее на поле битвы под вашим контролем. Затем тот игрок тасует свою библиотеку.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Сфинкс\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200126&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d65339db-c276-4eed-96d7-3890fbd202cd\', \'multiverseId\': 200126}, \'multiverseid\': 200126}, {\'name\': \'史芬斯大使\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n每当史芬斯大使对牌手造成战斗伤害时，从该牌手的牌库中搜寻一张牌，然后该牌手说出一个牌名。 如果你搜寻的是生物牌且并非该牌名，则你可以将它在你的操控下放进战场。 然后该牌手将他的牌库洗牌。\', \'type\': \'生物～史芬斯\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200873&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf519a2c-651f-4229-b822-457a15fa1130\', \'multiverseId\': 200873}, \'multiverseid\': 200873}]', '[{\'name\': \'Brennende Frage\', \'text\': \'Jeder Spieler zieht drei Karten und wirft dann drei zufällig bestimmte Karten aus seiner Hand ab.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Jariad arbeitete bis spät in die Nacht und kämpfte sich durch eine Schriftrolle nach der anderen, bis sein Kopf qualmte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199683&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e7fca0a6-f45e-49ac-ab17-99de40762d8f\', \'multiverseId\': 199683}, \'multiverseid\': 199683}, {\'name\': \'Pesquisa ardiente\', \'text\': \'Cada jugador roba tres cartas, luego descarta tres cartas al azar.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Jariad se quemó las pestañas, quemó un pergamino tras otro, y luego quemó su laboratorio.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200679&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c94b8a33-ce47-42d2-b305-8e4fa80ad45e\', \'multiverseId\': 200679}, \'multiverseid\': 200679}, {\'name\': \'Requête brûlante\', \'text\': \'Chaque joueur pioche trois cartes, puis se défausse de trois cartes au hasard.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Jariad savait qu\'il fallait se brûler les doigts pour apprendre, mais de là à incendier ses parchemins et son laboratoire...", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199434&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e944ab22-1382-4cfe-a6c6-491e1453d588\', \'multiverseId\': 199434}, \'multiverseid\': 199434}, {\'name\': \'Indagine Scottante\', \'text\': \'Ogni giocatore pesca tre carte, poi scarta tre carte a caso.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': "Jariad bruciò tutto l\'olio durante la notte, bruciò pergamena dopo pergamena e poi incenerì il suo laboratorio.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200430&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b9d08fb7-dfb0-4455-afec-d21d17361278\', \'multiverseId\': 200430}, \'multiverseid\': 200430}, {\'name\': \'燃え立つ調査\', \'text\': \'各プレイヤーはカードを３枚引き、その後カードを３枚無作為に選んで捨てる。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'ジャリアドは夜を徹して情熱を燃やし、巻物を次々と燃やし、ついには研究所を燃やし尽くしてしまった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199932&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f88c8bed-ff65-4ae9-9605-1c42f9b55ab1\', \'multiverseId\': 199932}, \'multiverseid\': 199932}, {\'name\': \'Inquisição Ardente\', \'text\': \'Cada jogador compra três cards e descarta três cards aleatórios.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Jariad queimou tanto as pestanas, passando de pergaminho a pergaminho, que a ardência de sua busca incendiou seu laboratório.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199185&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b918a59-bf78-451d-aa3f-17389ac12371\', \'multiverseId\': 199185}, \'multiverseid\': 199185}, {\'name\': \'Горящий Вопрос\', \'text\': \'Каждый игрок берет три карты, затем сбрасывает три случайно выбранные карты.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Джариад был в таком запале, что сжег дотла свою лабораторию.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200181&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e617c2f-4394-47de-90af-49cc630ff0ad\', \'multiverseId\': 200181}, \'multiverseid\': 200181}, {\'name\': \'火热探究\', \'text\': \'每位牌手抓三张牌，然后随机弃三张牌。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'贾烈点起夜灯，逐一翻阅卷轴，最后连实验室也烧毁了。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200928&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d97cd786-f9b4-4e6a-a841-3619635da2fd\', \'multiverseId\': 200928}, \'multiverseid\': 200928}]', '[{\'name\': \'Brennende Unordnung\', \'text\': \'Brennende Unordnung fügt 3 Schadenspunkte zu, deren Aufteilung auf eine beliebige Anzahl an weißen und/oder blauen Kreaturen deiner Wahl du bestimmst.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Der Schamane schlurfte durch die Hallen der Akademie und schüttelte seinen Kopf über den ganzen Pomp und das Gefasel der Weisen. Sofort fiel ihm ein, mit welchem Zauberspruch er Unfrieden stiften konnte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199696&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64b165f5-9244-4ba7-852f-c34e6676e4e7\', \'multiverseId\': 199696}, \'multiverseid\': 199696}, {\'name\': \'Encender el desorden\', \'text\': \'Encender el desorden hace 3 puntos de daño divididos como elijas entre cualquier número de criaturas blancas y/o azules objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'El chamán merodeaba los salones de la academia, moviendo la cabeza ante la fastuosidad y el murmullo de los sabios que la habitaban. Pero conocía el hechizo perfecto para encender el lugar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200692&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d9f083f-b496-4c15-954b-081e6293a090\', \'multiverseId\': 200692}, \'multiverseid\': 200692}, {\'name\': \'Embrasement du désordre\', \'text\': "L\'Embrasement du désordre inflige 3 blessures réparties comme vous le voulez entre n\'importe quel nombre de créatures blanches et/ou bleues ciblées.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Le shamane traversa les salles de l\'académie, désapprouvant les babillages et la vanité des sages qui s\'y trouvaient. Il avait le sort idéal pour créer une parfaite ambiance .", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199447&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e22bdca0-34d1-40fe-8b68-ef88dc80ccdd\', \'multiverseId\': 199447}, \'multiverseid\': 199447}, {\'name\': \'Scatenare il Disordine\', \'text\': \'Scatenare il Disordine infligge 3 danni divisi a tua scelta tra un qualsiasi numero di creature bianche e/o blu bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': "Lo sciamano si aggirava per le sale dell\'accademia, scuotendo la testa allo sfarzo e agli sproloqui dei saggi all\'interno. Conosceva giusto la magia adatta a ravvivare quel posto.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200443&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'364d04d6-aa9c-43a7-8a6e-9d1b8fe03454\', \'multiverseId\': 200443}, \'multiverseid\': 200443}, {\'name\': \'無秩序の点火\', \'text\': \'望む数の白か青のクリーチャーを対象とする。無秩序の点火はそれらに、３点のダメージを好きなように割り振って与える。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'シャーマンはアカデミーの広間をうろつき、そこの賢者達の虚飾と無駄口に対して首を振った。 この場所を活気付けるには、呪文一つで十分だ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199945&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48a72e37-3af5-47b3-b3a9-4ce0145735e8\', \'multiverseId\': 199945}, \'multiverseid\': 199945}, {\'name\': \'Incitar Desordem\', \'text\': \'Incitar Desordem causa 3 pontos de dano distribuídos à sua escolha entre qualquer número de criaturas alvo brancas e/ou azuis.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'O xamã vagou pelos corredores da academia, desaprovando os pomposos e prolixos sábios que encontrava. Ele conhecia a mágica perfeita para animar aquele lugar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199198&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec1141d8-0cd7-458b-b0b4-49f0bf9ebb65\', \'multiverseId\': 199198}, \'multiverseid\': 199198}, {\'name\': \'Разжигание Беспорядков\', \'text\': \'Разжигание Беспорядков наносит 3 повреждения, распределенные по вашему выбору между любым количеством целевых белых и (или) синих существ.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Шаман рыскал по залам академии, не одобряя ни церемонность, ни тихий лепет местных мудрецов. Он знал прекрасное заклинание, способное оживить это место.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200194&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0cc02e7-a8fc-4bd1-928a-cd2af97d630c\', \'multiverseId\': 200194}, \'multiverseid\': 200194}, {\'name\': \'煽动混乱\', \'text\': \'煽动混乱对任意数量的目标白色和／或蓝色生物造成共3点伤害，你可以任意分配。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'祭师在学院厅堂内巡荡，对着里面智者的头颅与絮叨摇头。 他正好知道哪个咒语能让这地方活起来。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200941&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f4d9b28-ff9e-4932-920b-1f5ef95bd55a\', \'multiverseId\': 200941}, \'multiverseid\': 200941}]', '[{\'name\': \'Chandra Nalaar\', \'text\': \'+1: Chandra Nalaar fügt einem Spieler deiner Wahl 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\\n-X: Chandra Nalaar fügt einer Kreatur deiner Wahl X Schadenspunkte zu.\\n-8: Chandra Nalaar fügt einem Spieler deiner Wahl und jeder Kreatur, die er kontrolliert, 10 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Chandra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199687&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bfdf43f3-03ed-4c11-a216-d7bd97967ac3\', \'multiverseId\': 199687}, \'multiverseid\': 199687}, {\'name\': \'Chandra Nalaar\', \'text\': \'+1: Chandra Nalaar hace 1 punto de daño al jugador objetivo.\\n-X: Chandra Nalaar hace X puntos de daño a la criatura objetivo.\\n-8: Chandra Nalaar hace 10 puntos de daño al jugador objetivo y a cada criatura que controla.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Chandra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200683&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'adad06e3-317f-4d75-8f29-331330ec7221\', \'multiverseId\': 200683}, \'multiverseid\': 200683}, {\'name\': \'Chandra Nalaàr\', \'text\': "+1 : Chandra Nalaàr inflige 1 blessure au joueur ciblé.\\n-X : Chandra Nalaàr inflige X blessures à la créature ciblée.\\n-8 : Chandra Nalaàr inflige 10 blessures au joueur ciblé et à chaque créature qu\'il contrôle.", \'type\': \'Planeswalker : Chandra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199438&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d700c5b1-34ab-49ce-8783-e2d322cc1ab9\', \'multiverseId\': 199438}, \'multiverseid\': 199438}, {\'name\': \'Chandra Nalaar\', \'text\': \'+1: Chandra Nalaar infligge 1 danno a un giocatore bersaglio.\\n-X: Chandra Nalaar infligge X danni a una creatura bersaglio.\\n-8: Chandra Nalaar infligge 10 danni a un giocatore bersaglio e a ogni creatura controllata da quel giocatore.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Chandra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200434&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5edcf0c7-78b6-467c-89e9-25a98792d613\', \'multiverseId\': 200434}, \'multiverseid\': 200434}, {\'name\': \'チャンドラ・ナラー\', \'text\': \'+1：プレイヤー１人を対象とする。チャンドラ・ナラーはそのプレイヤーに１点のダメージを与える。\\n-X：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。チャンドラ・ナラーはそれにＸ点のダメージを与える。\\n-8：プレイヤー１人を対象とする。チャンドラ・ナラーはそのプレイヤーとそのプレイヤーがコントロールする各クリーチャーにそれぞれ10点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'プレインズウォーカー — チャンドラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199936&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'16d36cc4-9fb4-4dea-bc3d-1d66d11961b7\', \'multiverseId\': 199936}, \'multiverseid\': 199936}, {\'name\': \'Chandra Nalaar\', \'text\': \'+1: Chandra Nalaar causa 1 ponto de dano ao jogador alvo.\\n-X: Chandra Nalaar causa X pontos de dano à criatura alvo.\\n-8: Chandra Nalaar causa 10 pontos de dano ao jogador alvo e a cada criatura que ele controla.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Chandra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199189&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c0b1ddd-6f7b-4995-9e16-575260736875\', \'multiverseId\': 199189}, \'multiverseid\': 199189}, {\'name\': \'Чандра Налаар\', \'text\': \'+1: Чандра Налаар наносит 1 повреждение целевому игроку.\\n-X: Чандра Налаар наносит Х повреждений целевому существу.\\n-8: Чандра Налаар наносит 10 повреждений целевому игроку и каждому существу под его контролем.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Чандра\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200185&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c8e22fb-7b50-4973-863a-8977584c9b01\', \'multiverseId\': 200185}, \'multiverseid\': 200185}, {\'name\': \'茜卓纳拉\', \'text\': \'+1：茜卓纳拉对目标牌手造成1点伤害。\\n-X：茜卓纳拉对目标生物造成X点伤害。\\n-8：茜卓纳拉对目标牌手与该牌手所操控的每个生物各造成10点伤害。\', \'type\': \'鹏洛客～茜卓\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200932&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a543ee3-8a97-47cc-ae22-477ff6d4a1de\', \'multiverseId\': 200932}, \'multiverseid\': 200932}]', '[{\'name\': \'Das Auge des Kraken\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein Spieler einen blauen Zauberspruch wirkt, kannst du 1 Lebenspunkt dazuerhalten.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Hell wie ein Spiegel, dunkel wie die See.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199768&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73149bcd-9ec1-451a-a138-149e05066e6d\', \'multiverseId\': 199768}, \'multiverseid\': 199768}, {\'name\': \'Ojo de kraken\', \'text\': \'Siempre que un jugador lance un hechizo azul, puedes ganar 1 vida.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Brillante como un espejo, oscuro como el mar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200764&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8344ac8-52ad-4fab-bbbc-bd8734f003ee\', \'multiverseId\': 200764}, \'multiverseid\': 200764}, {\'name\': \'Œil du kraken\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un joueur lance un sort bleu, vous pouvez gagner 1 point de vie.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "L\'éclat du diamant, la noirceur des profondeurs.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199519&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db91cec3-407c-4e5e-85a5-ae85b71f6759\', \'multiverseId\': 199519}, \'multiverseid\': 199519}, {\'name\': \'Occhio del Kraken\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta un giocatore lancia una magia blu, puoi guadagnare 1 punto vita.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'Radioso come uno specchio, scuro come il mare.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200515&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59985915-6acd-4fda-b598-25ed3ca63ec1\', \'multiverseId\': 200515}, \'multiverseid\': 200515}, {\'name\': \'クラーケンの目\', \'text\': \'いずれかのプレイヤーが青の呪文を唱えるたび、あなたは１点のライフを得てもよい。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'鏡の如く明るく、海の如く暗い。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200017&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1700bbcc-1cd4-4cd6-af3b-adaa16f9c153\', \'multiverseId\': 200017}, \'multiverseid\': 200017}, {\'name\': \'Olho de Kraken\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que um jogador conjurar uma mágica azul, você pode ganhar 1 ponto de vida.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'Brilhante como um espelho, escuro como o mar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199270&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc448fea-febd-4e69-a494-59224e9ec570\', \'multiverseId\': 199270}, \'multiverseid\': 199270}, {\'name\': \'Глаз Кракена\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда игрок разыгрывает синее заклинание, вы можете получить 1 жизнь.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'Блестящий, как зеркало, темный, как морская пучина.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200266&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'564ebafe-1128-4b3e-9d83-09cf9e76ee15\', \'multiverseId\': 200266}, \'multiverseid\': 200266}, {\'name\': \'巨怪硕眼\', \'text\': \'每当牌手施放任何蓝色咒语时，你可以获得1点生命。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'亮似明镜，黯如深洋。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=201013&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'087980aa-370d-498e-960f-f4b97c84c8cc\', \'multiverseId\': 201013}, \'multiverseid\': 201013}]', '[{\'name\': \'Desorientieren\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält -7/-0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Wenn es ein Hirn hat, und sei es noch so primitiv, können wir es sicher verwirren." —Garild, Meervolkmagier\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199603&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f011e1c-edaa-443a-abe6-6f95b9e2d65a\', \'multiverseId\': 199603}, \'multiverseid\': 199603}, {\'name\': \'Desorientar\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo obtiene -7/-0 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Si tiene un cerebro, incluso uno primitivo, seguramente podamos interferirlo." —Garild, hechicero tritón\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200599&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'421cddda-fd1e-48b6-ba9d-9562725909a1\', \'multiverseId\': 200599}, \'multiverseid\': 200599}, {\'name\': \'Désorientation\', \'text\': "La créature ciblée gagne -7/-0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Tant qu\'il a un cerveau, aussi primitif soit-il, nous pourrons le brouiller. » —Garild, mage ondin", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199354&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ae902eb-2552-44a7-a195-a92b18ddab28\', \'multiverseId\': 199354}, \'multiverseid\': 199354}, {\'name\': \'Sfasare\', \'text\': \'Una creatura bersaglio prende -7/-0 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Se ha un cervello, anche se primitivo, possiamo sicuramente confonderlo." —Garild, mago tritone\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200350&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c83f18b-25ca-4fb9-9165-f8648c1cc1df\', \'multiverseId\': 200350}, \'multiverseid\': 200350}, {\'name\': \'認識不能\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それはターン終了時まで－７/－０の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「原始的なものだろうと、脳があるんなら間違いなく引っ掻き回せるさ。」 ――マーフォークの魔道士、ガリルド\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199852&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7db2863a-83d7-478d-bffc-6a59ec56e1c1\', \'multiverseId\': 199852}, \'multiverseid\': 199852}, {\'name\': \'Desorientar\', \'text\': \'A criatura alvo recebe -7/-0 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Se tiver um cérebro, que seja primitivo, certamente poderemos o emaranhar." —Garild, tritão mago\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199105&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70d7ad10-d310-4704-a292-2410d3ef6014\', \'multiverseId\': 199105}, \'multiverseid\': 199105}, {\'name\': \'Дезориентировать\', \'text\': \'Целевое существо получает -7/-0 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Если у него есть мозг, пусть даже примитивный, мы наверняка сможем его запутать». — Гарилд, мерфолк-волшебник\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200101&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65c3c378-2c81-4a60-967b-71e1686b71c8\', \'multiverseId\': 200101}, \'multiverseid\': 200101}, {\'name\': \'令其迷惘\', \'text\': \'目标生物得-7/-0直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「只要是有脑的，我们都能让它混乱；就算是最原始的也行。」 ～人鱼法师加俐得\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200848&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'04b50799-0794-48f3-a005-1a840881afd8\', \'multiverseId\': 200848}, \'multiverseid\': 200848}]', '[{\'name\': \'Die Schatzkammern öffnen\', \'text\': \'Bringe alle Artefakt- und Verzauberungskarten aus allen Friedhöfen unter der Kontrolle ihrer Besitzer zurück ins Spiel. (Auren, die nichts zum Verzaubern haben, bleiben auf dem Friedhof.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Wenn die Schatzkammern leer sind, ist jeder reich.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199576&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'289e115a-6aa1-4018-9668-6d867b605314\', \'multiverseId\': 199576}, \'multiverseid\': 199576}, {\'name\': \'Abrir las bóvedas\', \'text\': \'Regresa al campo de batalla bajo el control de sus propietarios todas las cartas de artefacto y encantamiento de todos los cementerios. (Las auras que no tengan nada que encantar permanecen en los cementerios.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Cuando las bóvedas están vacías, todos son ricos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200572&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9cc89f0f-e3ef-4885-ac85-d59d910736cb\', \'multiverseId\': 200572}, \'multiverseid\': 200572}, {\'name\': \'Ouvrez les chambres fortes !\', \'text\': "Renvoyez, sous le contrôle de leurs propriétaires, toutes les cartes d\'artefact et d\'enchantement de tous les cimetières sur le champ de bataille. (Les auras qui n\'ont rien à enchanter restent dans les cimetières.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'Quand les coffres sont vides, tout le monde est riche.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199327&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dbca49d8-6133-4392-8f17-b0b16a0dd3ce\', \'multiverseId\': 199327}, \'multiverseid\': 199327}, {\'name\': \'Aprire le Cripte\', \'text\': \'Rimetti sul campo di battaglia tutte le carte artefatto e incantesimo da tutti i cimiteri sotto il controllo dei loro proprietari. (Le Aure che non hanno nulla da incantare rimangono nei cimiteri.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Quando le cripte sono vuote, tutti ci guadagnano.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200323&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'128908c9-c29b-4d93-8c0a-628a464de1f7\', \'multiverseId\': 200323}, \'multiverseid\': 200323}, {\'name\': \'蔵の開放\', \'text\': \'すべての墓地にあるすべてのアーティファクト・カードとエンチャント・カードを、オーナーのコントロール下で戦場に戻す。 （エンチャントするもののないオーラは墓地に残る。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'蔵が空になれば、みんなが金持ちになる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199825&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fda51dcc-7626-4bff-956c-2df387b015b1\', \'multiverseId\': 199825}, \'multiverseid\': 199825}, {\'name\': \'Abrir os Cofres\', \'text\': \'Devolva para o campo de batalha sob o controle de seus donos todos os cards de artefato e encantamento em todos os cemitérios. (As auras sem nada para encantar permanecem nos cemitérios.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Quando os cofres estão vazios, todos são ricos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199078&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e1868f7-55f7-4f70-810b-dcb7261828d9\', \'multiverseId\': 199078}, \'multiverseid\': 199078}, {\'name\': \'Открыть Хранилища\', \'text\': \'Верните все карты артефактов и чар из всех кладбищ на поле битвы под контролем их владельцев. (Ауры, которым нечего зачаровывать, остаются на кладбищах.)\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Когда в хранилищах пусто, все богаты.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200074&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d542d3e3-3940-4333-8490-84397b922e89\', \'multiverseId\': 200074}, \'multiverseid\': 200074}, {\'name\': \'打开地窖\', \'text\': \'将所有坟墓场中的所有神器与结界牌在其拥有者的操控下返回战场。 （没有东西可结附的灵气牌会留在坟墓场中。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'等地窖搬空，大家就都不愁吃穿了。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200821&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7811df1f-1e59-4801-8c65-c39270419e04\', \'multiverseId\': 200821}, \'multiverseid\': 200821}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dorngestrüppkriecher\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn der Dorngestrüppkriecher angreift, erhält er +5/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elementarwesen\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich habe schon gesehen, wie ein ausgewachsenes Exemplar in Sekunden einen Baloth in blutige Stücke zerrissen hat." —Kivi, Dornenbeeren-Ernter\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199726&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a912338f-c069-44c7-96ca-2d60ae58e76a\', \'multiverseId\': 199726}, \'multiverseid\': 199726}, {\'name\': \'Trepador de zarzas\', \'text\': \'Siempre que el Trepador de zarzas ataque, obtiene +5/+0 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': \'"He visto a los más grandes convertir a un baloth en restos sangrientos en segundos." —Kivi, cosechadora de bayas espinosas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200722&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'30ef3af6-c273-4bd0-8cb3-e9f002782ec5\', \'multiverseId\': 200722}, \'multiverseid\': 200722}, {\'name\': \'Fureteur des ronces\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que le Fureteur des ronces attaque, il gagne +5/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : élémental\', \'flavor\': "« J\'en ai vu de taille adulte qui déchiquetaient un baloth en quelques secondes. » —Kivi, récolteur de baies", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199477&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db518c94-0a27-4fcd-a09d-9b5efd93838d\', \'multiverseId\': 199477}, \'multiverseid\': 199477}, {\'name\': \'Strisciante dei Rovi\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta lo Strisciante dei Rovi attacca, prende +5/+0 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Elementale\', \'flavor\': \'"Ho visto quelli cresciuti fare a brandelli un baloth in pochi secondi." —Kivi, raccoglitrice di bacche spinose\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200473&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44ff945d-c2ae-461e-97d4-1b2e12dde756\', \'multiverseId\': 200473}, \'multiverseid\': 200473}, {\'name\': \'棘茨の忍び寄るもの\', \'text\': \'棘茨の忍び寄るものが攻撃するたび、それはターン終了時まで＋５/＋０の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エレメンタル\', \'flavor\': \'「成長しきったのが、ベイロスを一瞬で引きちぎったのを見たことがあるわ。」 ――棘苺の収穫人、キヴィ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199975&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f55ac857-c755-41c2-9ef7-a8dbf7462ae6\', \'multiverseId\': 199975}, \'multiverseid\': 199975}, {\'name\': \'Liana Lenhosa\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que Liana Lenhosa ataca, recebe +5/+0 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': \'"Quando totalmente formadas, são capazes de despedaçar um baloth em poucos segundos ." —Kivi, colhedor de frutespinho\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199228&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d6f8bee4-39b3-4330-82bc-f30e20dc6360\', \'multiverseId\': 199228}, \'multiverseid\': 199228}, {\'name\': \'Терновый Ползун\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда Терновый Ползун атакует, он получает +5/+0 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Элементаль\', \'flavor\': \'«Я видел, как взрослые особи в считанные секунды раздирали балота в кровавые клочья». — Киви, собиратель терновых ягод\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200224&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4e6ae57-c584-4866-812e-8bce1b3ac47f\', \'multiverseId\': 200224}, \'multiverseid\': 200224}, {\'name\': \'竹林匍行怪\', \'text\': \'每当竹林匍行怪攻击时，它得+5/+0直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～元素\', \'flavor\': \'「我看过完全长成的在几秒内就把巴洛西撕成一条条。」 ～采刺莓人齐薇\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200971&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1e53d9e-5d07-40a9-bf31-21f186aba9dc\', \'multiverseId\': 200971}, \'multiverseid\': 200971}]', '[{\'name\': \'Drachenjunges\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\n{R}: Das Drachenjunge erhält +1/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges. Opfere zu Beginn des Endsegments das Drachenjunge, falls diese Fähigkeit in diesem Zug vier Mal oder öfter aktiviert wurde.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Drache\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199688&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bfdd84b0-c4de-4c9c-aae5-8cf5d4c56a29\', \'multiverseId\': 199688}, \'multiverseid\': 199688}, {\'name\': \'Cría de dragón\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\n{R}: La Cría de dragón obtiene +1/+0 hasta el final del turno. Al comienzo del paso final, si esta habilidad fue activada cuatro o más veces este turno, sacrifica la Cría de dragón.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragón\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200684&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'49aa2555-f3f4-49af-b746-a606e92d41a8\', \'multiverseId\': 200684}, \'multiverseid\': 200684}, {\'name\': \'Dragonnet\', \'text\': "Vol\\n{R} : Le Dragonnet gagne +1/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Au début de l\'étape de fin, si cette capacité a été activée au moins quatre fois ce tour-ci, sacrifiez le Dragonnet.", \'type\': \'Créature : dragon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199439&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85fc1eb5-10dc-49b2-8481-7203a6af56c1\', \'multiverseId\': 199439}, \'multiverseid\': 199439}, {\'name\': \'Cucciolo di Drago\', \'text\': "Volare\\n{R}: Il Cucciolo di Drago prende +1/+0 fino alla fine del turno. All\'inizio della sottofase finale, se questa abilità è stata attivata quattro o più volte in questo turno, sacrifica il Cucciolo di Drago.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Drago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200435&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0a15635-904f-4b81-9948-04a7345f3320\', \'multiverseId\': 200435}, \'multiverseid\': 200435}, {\'name\': \'チビ・ドラゴン\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n{R}：チビ・ドラゴンはターン終了時まで＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。 終了ステップの開始時に、このターンこの能力が４回以上起動されている場合、チビ・ドラゴンを生け贄に捧げる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドラゴン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199937&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42bf4ca3-4c66-4145-b26f-b4d03c8be81e\', \'multiverseId\': 199937}, \'multiverseid\': 199937}, {\'name\': \'Filhote de Dragão\', \'text\': \'Voar\\n{R}: Filhote de Dragão recebe +1/+0 até o final do turno. No início da etapa final, se esta habilidade tiver sido ativada quatro ou mais vezes neste turno, sacrifique Filhote de Dragão.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragão\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199190&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bbaba87b-afd5-4198-b2bd-614ff73924a5\', \'multiverseId\': 199190}, \'multiverseid\': 199190}, {\'name\': \'Детеныш Дракона\', \'text\': \'Полет\\n{R}: Детеныш Дракона получает +1/+0 до конца хода. В начале заключительного шага, если эта способность была активирована четыре или больше раз за этот ход, пожертвуйте Детеныша Дракона.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Дракон\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200186&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8223e65-6c5e-4849-9c99-28376447d005\', \'multiverseId\': 200186}, \'multiverseid\': 200186}, {\'name\': \'幼龙\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n{R}：幼龙得+1/+0直到回合结束。 在结束步骤开始时，若此异能于本回合中起动了四次或更多，则牺牲幼龙。\', \'type\': \'生物～龙\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200933&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0884ebe0-4a44-41e2-a966-84669c2c33d7\', \'multiverseId\': 200933}, \'multiverseid\': 200933}]', '[{\'name\': \'Drachenklaue\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein Spieler einen roten Zauberspruch wirkt, kannst du 1 Lebenspunkt dazuerhalten.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Obwohl sie nicht mehr am Finger befestigt ist, hält sie weiter ihren Gegner fest im Griff.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199765&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eddf9edf-b9ab-40e4-bcb9-51abfa56e90e\', \'multiverseId\': 199765}, \'multiverseid\': 199765}, {\'name\': \'Garra de dragón\', \'text\': \'Siempre que un jugador lance un hechizo rojo, puedes ganar 1 vida.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Aunque ya no está anexada a la mano, todavía tiene agarrado a su adversario.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200761&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60f942cf-ed6e-4988-be41-ae0e4c515cdf\', \'multiverseId\': 200761}, \'multiverseid\': 200761}, {\'name\': \'Griffe du dragon\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un joueur lance un sort rouge, vous pouvez gagner 1 point de vie.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': \'Bien que détachée de la patte, elle enserre toujours sa proie.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199516&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42a5376e-1bfa-453c-b39c-63d73122b126\', \'multiverseId\': 199516}, \'multiverseid\': 199516}, {\'name\': \'Artiglio di Drago\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta un giocatore lancia una magia rossa, puoi guadagnare 1 punto vita.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': "Anche se non è più attaccato alla zampa, serra ancora l\'avversario nella propria morsa.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200512&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2aeae935-74a6-4715-a5af-1a8350111214\', \'multiverseId\': 200512}, \'multiverseid\': 200512}, {\'name\': \'ドラゴンの爪\', \'text\': \'いずれかのプレイヤーが赤の呪文を唱えるたび、あなたは１点のライフを得てもよい。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'すでに手から離されたにもかかわらず、それは今でも敵を掴んでいる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200014&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17d231ec-a0e9-473a-8fc2-4042ced2ca30\', \'multiverseId\': 200014}, \'multiverseid\': 200014}, {\'name\': \'Garra de Dragão\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que um jogador conjurar uma mágica vermelha, você pode ganhar 1 ponto de vida.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'Embora não esteja mais ligada à mão, ainda mantém seu adversário em suas garras.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199267&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87eb9f7a-005b-4e0f-b0ad-9ee5c0a3eafb\', \'multiverseId\': 199267}, \'multiverseid\': 199267}, {\'name\': \'Коготь Дракона\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда игрок разыгрывает красное заклинание, вы можете получить 1 жизнь.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'Даже выдранный из лапы хозяина, он держит неприятеля мертвой хваткой.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200263&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6eca935d-d1b0-490c-90fc-d605eb48ddeb\', \'multiverseId\': 200263}, \'multiverseid\': 200263}, {\'name\': \'巨龙钩爪\', \'text\': \'每当牌手施放任何红色咒语时，你可以获得1点生命。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'虽已不在龙掌之上，却似乎依然紧扣着敌手不放。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=201010&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b51cac9-6e76-470f-bd6d-07e9affc6101\', \'multiverseId\': 201010}, \'multiverseid\': 201010}]', "[{'name': 'Drachenschädel-Pass', 'text': 'Der Drachenschädel-Pass kommt getappt ins Spiel, falls du nicht einen Sumpf oder ein Gebirge kontrollierst.\\n{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {B} oder {R}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199778&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bc39c3c0-02a4-481b-9d8d-0f98048205ea', 'multiverseId': 199778}, 'multiverseid': 199778}, {'name': 'Cumbre Cráneo de Dragón', 'text': 'La Cumbre Cráneo de Dragón entra al campo de batalla girada a menos que controles un pantano o una montaña.\\n{T}: Agrega {B} o {R} a tu reserva de maná.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200774&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2861ac8c-24b1-451b-bae5-0f0566ccc800', 'multiverseId': 200774}, 'multiverseid': 200774}, {'name': 'Sommet du Crânedragon', 'text': 'Le Sommet du Crânedragon arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé à moins que vous ne contrôliez un marais ou une montagne.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {B} ou {R} à votre réserve.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199529&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '72bdeb23-09f3-4e9b-86f8-721ed25ff763', 'multiverseId': 199529}, 'multiverseid': 199529}, {'name': 'Vetta del Teschio di Drago', 'text': 'La Vetta del Teschio di Drago entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata a meno che tu non controlli una Palude o una Montagna.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {B} o {R} alla tua riserva di mana.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200525&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bac71f0a-572d-4983-b738-1e87e193b0c8', 'multiverseId': 200525}, 'multiverseid': 200525}, {'name': '竜髑髏の山頂', 'text': '竜髑髏の山頂は、あなたが沼か山をコントロールしていないかぎり、タップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{B}か{R}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200027&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'db5cb372-657b-4658-a9b4-dbb64958c3d7', 'multiverseId': 200027}, 'multiverseid': 200027}, {'name': 'Pico da Caveira de Dragão', 'text': 'Pico da Caveira de Dragão entra no campo de batalha virado a menos que você controle um Pântano ou uma Montanha.\\n{T}: Adicione {B} ou {R} à sua reserva de mana.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199280&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ea7a7a07-e069-419d-94c4-dfa487f8cb0e', 'multiverseId': 199280}, 'multiverseid': 199280}, {'name': 'Пик Драконьего Черепа', 'text': 'Пик Драконьего Черепа выходит на поле битвы повернутым, если только под вашим контролем нет Болота или Горы.\\n{T}: добавьте {B} или {R} в ваше хранилище маны.', 'type': 'Земля', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200276&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f0293233-f16c-4e3c-9667-0ff0b88f8a64', 'multiverseId': 200276}, 'multiverseid': 200276}, {'name': '龙颅山峰', 'text': '除非你操控沼泽或山脉，否则龙颅山峰须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{B}或{R}到你的法术力池中。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=201023&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ad5232e4-938a-4fbb-8575-0b8fbb14bdf2', 'multiverseId': 201023}, 'multiverseid': 201023}]", '[{\'name\': \'Drohender Schatten\', \'text\': \'{B}: Der Drohende Schatten erhält +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Schatten\', \'flavor\': \'Sein Umriss kommt nie zur Ruhe, wird immer von einem unbekannten Sturm aus der Düsternis herausgeworfen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199658&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d5827af-159c-4539-86e9-d5206669bfea\', \'multiverseId\': 199658}, \'multiverseid\': 199658}, {\'name\': \'Sombra vaga\', \'text\': \'{B}: La Sombra vaga obtiene +1/+1 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Sombra\', \'flavor\': \'Su forma nunca descansa, impulsada por alguna brisa indetectable del más allá.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200654&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef8369cb-a837-4a25-8253-7a59604acf4c\', \'multiverseId\': 200654}, \'multiverseid\': 200654}, {\'name\': \'Ombre surgissante\', \'text\': "{B} : L\'Ombre surgissante gagne +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : ombre\', \'flavor\': "Sa forme, propulsée d\'au-delà des ténèbres par un vent indétectable, ne connaît jamais le repos.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199409&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40ee0429-a1af-4b74-af7d-3250771fd4db\', \'multiverseId\': 199409}, \'multiverseid\': 199409}, {\'name\': \'Bruma in Agguato\', \'text\': \'{B}: La Bruma in Agguato prende +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Ombra\', \'flavor\': \'La sua forma non ha mai pace, sospinta da una brezza impercettibile che giunge dalle tenebre.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200405&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd1575c8-8fac-4336-a5b6-e4d4a5ceaf1e\', \'multiverseId\': 200405}, \'multiverseid\': 200405}, {\'name\': \'立ちはだかる影\', \'text\': \'{B}：立ちはだかる影はターン終了時まで+1/+1の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — シェイド\', \'flavor\': \'その姿は、暗がりの向こうからの予期せぬ突風に押されるかのように、一つかたちに留まることがない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199907&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be052eb9-9888-4717-b11e-0e02b2d9b2b6\', \'multiverseId\': 199907}, \'multiverseid\': 199907}, {\'name\': \'Vulto Indistinto\', \'text\': \'{B}: Vulto Indistinto recebe +1/+1 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Sombra\', \'flavor\': \'Sua forma nunca descansa, propulsionada por algum vendaval indetectável de além das trevas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199160&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4220daca-6549-414d-ad5c-653b93029948\', \'multiverseId\': 199160}, \'multiverseid\': 199160}, {\'name\': \'Смутная Тень\', \'text\': \'{B}: Смутная Тень получает +1/+1 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Тень\', \'flavor\': \'Она не знает покоя, движимая невидимыми порывами запредельного мрака.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200156&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98586389-130c-418f-8c73-5af4bdbbe068\', \'multiverseId\': 200156}, \'multiverseid\': 200156}, {\'name\': \'昏暗阴魂\', \'text\': \'{B}：昏暗阴魂得+1/+1直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～阴魂\', \'flavor\': \'其外型从未固定，被无影阴风推压不已。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200903&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43ab0e4f-a920-4a0c-8974-fa0ae384b32c\', \'multiverseId\': 200903}, \'multiverseid\': 200903}]', "[{'name': 'Dschinn der Wünsche', 'text': 'Fliegend\\nDer Dschinn der Wünsche kommt mit drei Wunschmarken ins Spiel.\\n{2}{U}{U}, entferne eine Wunschmarke vom Dschinn der Wünsche: Zeige die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek offen vor. Du kannst diese Karte spielen, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen. Falls du es nicht tust, schicke sie ins Exil.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Dschinn', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199605&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b5497b0c-18fb-42c8-bf87-6ed6875bc22e', 'multiverseId': 199605}, 'multiverseid': 199605}, {'name': 'Djinn de los deseos', 'text': 'Vuela.\\nEl Djinn de los deseos entra al campo de batalla con tres contadores de deseo sobre él.\\n{2}{U}{U}, remover un contador de deseo del Djinn de los deseos: Muestra la primera carta de tu biblioteca. Puedes jugar esa carta sin pagar su coste de maná. Si no lo haces, exíliala.', 'type': 'Criatura — Djinn', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200601&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '04ca74ff-7a9e-41e4-b38d-d7b0bf9d7d2e', 'multiverseId': 200601}, 'multiverseid': 200601}, {'name': 'Djinn aux souhaits', 'text': 'Vol\\nLe Djinn aux souhaits arrive sur le champ de bataille avec, sur lui, trois marqueurs « souhait ».\\n{2}{U}{U}, retirez un marqueur « souhait » au Djinn aux souhaits : Révélez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez jouer cette carte sans payer son coût de mana. Si vous ne le faites pas, exilez-la.', 'type': 'Créature : djinn', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199356&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6e9624ff-1496-43d9-b33a-3b056795f063', 'multiverseId': 199356}, 'multiverseid': 199356}, {'name': 'Genio dei Desideri', 'text': 'Volare\\nIl Genio dei Desideri entra nel campo di battaglia con tre segnalini desiderio.\\n{2}{U}{U}, Rimuovi un segnalino desiderio dal Genio dei Desideri: Rivela la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Puoi giocare quella carta senza pagare il suo costo di mana. Se non lo fai, esiliala.', 'type': 'Creatura — Genio', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200352&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3d480b22-f39f-44f0-a8f5-63878bf6fbec', 'multiverseId': 200352}, 'multiverseid': 200352}, {'name': '願いのジン', 'text': '飛行\\n願いのジンは、願いカウンターが３個置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\\n{2}{U}{U}, 願いのジンから願いカウンターを１個取り除く：あなたのライブラリーの一番上のカードを公開する。 あなたはそのカードをそのマナ・コストを支払うことなくプレイしてもよい。 そうしない場合、それを追放する。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ジン', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199854&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2e2d824b-bf95-4859-b6e2-2e2004e88d14', 'multiverseId': 199854}, 'multiverseid': 199854}, {'name': 'Djinn dos Desejos', 'text': 'Voar\\nDjinn dos Desejos entra no campo de batalha com três marcadores de desejo sobre ele.\\n{2}{U}{U}, Remova um marcador de desejo de Djinn dos Desejos: Revele o card do topo de seu grimório. Você pode jogar aquele card sem pagar seu custo de mana. Se não o fizer, exile-o.', 'type': 'Criatura — Gênio', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199107&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '54b85085-07b5-495d-bc6e-4fa30291bfec', 'multiverseId': 199107}, 'multiverseid': 199107}, {'name': 'Джинн Желаний', 'text': 'Полет\\nДжинн Желаний выходит на поле битвы с тремя жетонами желания на нем.\\n{2}{U}{U}, удалите жетон желания с Джинна Желаний: покажите верхнюю карту вашей библиотеки. Вы можете разыграть ту карту без уплаты её мана-стоимости. Если вы этого не делаете, изгоните ее.', 'type': 'Существо — Джинн', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200103&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5e704e3b-62aa-414d-92ef-df0b5a93d4bc', 'multiverseId': 200103}, 'multiverseid': 200103}, {'name': '祈愿巨灵', 'text': '飞行\\n祈愿巨灵进战场时上面有三个祈愿指示物。\\n{2}{U}{U}，从祈愿巨灵上移去一个祈愿指示物：展示你的牌库顶牌。 你可以使用该牌，且不需支付其法术力费用。 如果你不使用，则将它放逐。', 'type': '生物～巨灵', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200850&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '08e6f697-b4d4-46fb-a2da-153a093a9c97', 'multiverseId': 200850}, 'multiverseid': 200850}]", '[{\'name\': \'Dämonenhorn\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein Spieler einen schwarzen Zauberspruch wirkt, kannst du 1 Lebenspunkt dazuerhalten.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Seine Biegungen verspotten die Kurven von Leben und Tod.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199764&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4aed6df7-3b71-44ce-8838-f58ec8b8d917\', \'multiverseId\': 199764}, \'multiverseid\': 199764}, {\'name\': \'Cuerno de demonio\', \'text\': \'Siempre que un jugador lance un hechizo negro, puedes ganar 1 vida.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Su curvatura simboliza las vueltas de la vida y la muerte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200760&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b95070b6-c440-4554-8fe1-0dab51c73094\', \'multiverseId\': 200760}, \'multiverseid\': 200760}, {\'name\': \'Corne de démon\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un joueur lance un sort noir, vous pouvez gagner 1 point de vie.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': \'Ses courbes imitent les méandres de la vie et de la mort.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199515&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd6c2fae-3f87-4378-a9c2-53c13fa76671\', \'multiverseId\': 199515}, \'multiverseid\': 199515}, {\'name\': \'Corno del Demone\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta un giocatore lancia una magia nera, puoi guadagnare 1 punto vita.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'La sua foggia imita gli intrecci di vita e morte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200511&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17597ef9-2a89-4adb-829d-f8c14183fe24\', \'multiverseId\': 200511}, \'multiverseid\': 200511}, {\'name\': \'悪魔の角\', \'text\': \'いずれかのプレイヤーが黒の呪文を唱えるたび、あなたは１点のライフを得てもよい。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'その曲がり様は、生と死の絡み合いを模している。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200013&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c17eeeea-de8a-4063-bcfe-a7ecf657f086\', \'multiverseId\': 200013}, \'multiverseid\': 200013}, {\'name\': \'Chifre de Demônio\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que um jogador conjurar uma mágica preta, você pode ganhar 1 ponto de vida.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'Sua curvatura imita as viravoltas da vida e da morte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199266&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63f8f6f5-6711-4afc-97c9-de0d06f697d4\', \'multiverseId\': 199266}, \'multiverseid\': 199266}, {\'name\': \'Рог Демона\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда игрок разыгрывает черное заклинание, вы можете получить 1 жизнь.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'Его изгиб повторяет сплетение жизни и смерти.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200262&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68c3168d-204c-4555-a943-a4b9ea83c623\', \'multiverseId\': 200262}, \'multiverseid\': 200262}, {\'name\': \'恶魔犄角\', \'text\': \'每当牌手施放任何黑色咒语时，你可以获得1点生命。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'其弯弧好似生与死的纠结。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=201009&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97fb6d7b-042d-4319-80be-e1ab96436012\', \'multiverseId\': 201009}, \'multiverseid\': 201009}]', "[{'name': 'Ebene', 'type': 'Standardland — Ebene', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199785&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4f686d13-e161-428f-bfdd-31e064455af2', 'multiverseId': 199785}, 'multiverseid': 199785}, {'name': 'Llanura', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Llanura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=200781&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2603d151-1bf9-414f-b7a4-6ddd463d2973', 'multiverseId': 200781}, 'multiverseid': 200781}, {'name': 'Plaine', 'type': 'Terrain de base : plaine', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=199536&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0fff9c7a-b20e-4490-a862-55637467b58b', 'multiverseId': 199536}, 'multiverseid': 199536}, {'name': 'Pianura', 'type': 'Terra Base — Pianura', 'flavor'